Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.40,0:01:11.07,Title,0,0,0,0,,《黑衣人：全球追缉》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.41,0:01:28.25,Note,0,0,0,0,,（巴黎 2016年）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.71,0:01:35.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐 我太讨厌巴黎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, do I hate Paris.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.09,0:01:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 地球也许马上就毁灭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not to worry. Probably won't be around much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.72,0:01:52.66,Note,0,0,0,0,,（游客止步 禁止入内）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.20,0:02:03.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一刻我已经等了很久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been waiting a long time for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.70,0:02:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想说的是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess what… What I'm trying to say is,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.41,0:02:08.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 莉莎 你愿意嫁… - 你们好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lisa, will you mar… - Bonjour.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.96,0:02:11.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是铁塔保安\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're with Tower security.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.63,0:02:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're terribly sorry,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.75,0:02:15.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你们不应该来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you're not supposed to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.67,0:02:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抱歉 - 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry. - Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.47,0:02:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 她答应了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So? She say yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.43,0:02:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我还没求婚 - 他还没求婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I haven't asked yet. - He hasn't asked yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.26,0:02:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那真是太遗憾了 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's a terrible shame, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.31,0:02:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你们看 那边闪烁的灯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because, you see, that blinking light back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.60,0:02:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,说明二号传送门遭到入侵\N{\fnArial\fs30}means there's been a breach in Portal 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.81,0:02:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说 几分钟后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which means, in just a few minutes,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.23,0:02:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,全宇宙最邪恶的生物 蜂兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}the most vile creatures in the entire universe, the Hive,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.40,0:02:36.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,将把我们所有人从里到外吃得一干二净\N{\fnArial\fs30}are gonna consume every last one of us from the inside out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.99,0:02:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.24,0:02:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们只要盯着这里看\N{\fnArial\fs30}All will be explained if you look right…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.45,0:02:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,就懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.04,0:02:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,铁塔因修缮而关闭\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Tower was closed for repairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.83,0:02:49.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,下去的时候向她求婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask her on the way down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.71,0:02:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边请\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.04,0:02:54.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.25,0:02:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心缝隙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mind the gap.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.97,0:03:04.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.93,0:03:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.01,0:03:07.84,Note,0,0,0,0,,（游客止步 禁止入内）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.61,0:03:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.99,0:03:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.87,0:03:27.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,到地面后再向她求婚一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask her again down on the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.59,0:03:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你回来了 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There you are. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.51,0:03:42.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我们再试一次吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Let's try this again, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.43,0:03:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what's the play here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.77,0:03:54.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们以前经历过这种情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been in this situation before.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.77,0:03:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们从未对峙过蜂兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've never faced the Hive before.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.52,0:03:58.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们也从未对峙过我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've never faced us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.32,0:03:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,记好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always remember,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.78,0:04:01.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,宇宙总有办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}The universe has a way of leading you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.57,0:04:02.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,在恰当的时机\N{\fnArial\fs30}to where you're supposed to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.99,0:04:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,将你引向应该去的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}at the moment you're supposed to be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.12,0:04:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 有时候宇宙也会搞错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, sometimes, the universe gets it wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.28,0:04:29.16,Note,0,0,0,0,,（布鲁克林 二十年前）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.06,0:04:32.51,Note,0,0,0,0,,（你在这里）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.27,0:04:41.85,Title,0,0,0,0,,（《时间简史 从大爆炸到黑洞》 史蒂芬·霍金著）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.40,0:04:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们动起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Let's have some action.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.15,0:04:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,把屁股扭起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want some asses wiggling.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.03,0:04:48.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,要有进步\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want some perfection."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.58,0:04:53.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,去拿我的三号木杆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get my three-wood.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.92,0:04:56.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 麻利点 - 好好好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, let's go. - Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.78,0:04:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.09,0:05:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.39,0:05:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天啊 宝贝 - 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, my God. Baby. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.02,0:05:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本不是动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}That wasn't no animal, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.64,0:05:15.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是…是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a… It was a…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.69,0:05:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没见过这样的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ain't never seen nothing like that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.40,0:05:19.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,像是一个生物\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was, like, a creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.65,0:05:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 哈洛德 快报警\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Harold, call the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.03,0:05:25.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 报什么 - 报警 快报警\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The who? - The police. Call the police!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.20,0:05:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么快\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.66,0:05:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上好 我们是动物管理局的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good evening, folks. We're from Animal Control.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.78,0:05:31.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说看到了奇怪的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you saw something?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.74,0:05:33.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 但我们还没打电话呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. We haven't even called you yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.50,0:05:35.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有危险吗 它有狂犬病吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we in any danger? Does it have like, rabies?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.41,0:05:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不像是普通的动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}That wasn't a regular animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.46,0:05:39.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 像是… - 你见到的生物\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It was like… - The creature you saw was.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.63,0:05:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一只来自仙女座II的无证塔伦特\N{\fnArial\fs30}an unlicensed Tarantian from Andromeda II.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.55,0:05:44.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常稀有 非常危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very rare, very dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.13,0:05:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不好意思 你说什么 - 一只塔伦特 女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry, what? - A Tarantian. Ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.22,0:05:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 目前他看起来很可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I know. He looks cute now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.97,0:05:49.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 塔伦特 - 但是等到了青春期\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tarantian? - But when they hit puberty,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.39,0:05:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就会变成真正的怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}they turn into real monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.03,0:06:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,别害怕 没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be scared. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.36,0:06:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我 屋里还有别人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me, is there anyone else in the house?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.90,0:06:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有我们的女儿 她在睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just our daughter. She's sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.74,0:06:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,一只浣熊 没错 这就是你们的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}A raccoon. Yeah, that's your problem, folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.54,0:06:18.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,确保把垃圾桶的盖子盖紧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So just go ahead and make sure those trash can lids are on nice and tight,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.71,0:06:21.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没来过这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we were never here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.84,0:06:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们应该去看看莫莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we should go check on Molly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.72,0:06:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've gotta get you out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.26,0:06:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.31,0:06:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.36,0:06:46.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是你的朋友 我叫莫莉 去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm your friend. I'm Molly. Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.57,0:06:49.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Molly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.41,0:06:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kabla nakshulin\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kabla nakshulin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.45,0:06:58.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kabla nakshulin\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kabla nakshulin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.13,0:07:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫莉 你在每个领域都取得了优秀以上的成绩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Molly, you've scored excellent or above in every area.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.60,0:07:05.92,Note,0,0,0,0,,（联调局 纽约分部）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.92,0:07:08.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,身体素质 演绎推理 逻辑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fitness, deductive reasoning, logic,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.55,0:07:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,武器训练\N{\fnArial\fs30}weapons training.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.59,0:07:11.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just one problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.43,0:07:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没勾选\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't check a box.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.47,0:07:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,选择想去的部门\N{\fnArial\fs30}For your preferred division.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.60,0:07:19.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人都得勾选\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone has to check a box.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.65,0:07:25.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己为没有框的部门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I made my own box.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.27,0:07:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,画了一个框\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the division that has no box.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.16,0:07:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你懂的 这个部门的人都穿着黑色套装\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, the division where they wear black suits.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.24,0:07:37.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,负责处理…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and deal with the guys from…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.08,0:07:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面来的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.04,0:07:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说会计部门吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean, Accounting?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.92,0:07:46.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我是说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, like…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.05,0:07:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 还是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, still…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.34,0:07:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,会计部门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Accounting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.93,0:08:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样应该就能解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}That should fix the glitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.31,0:08:04.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 请记住 我们在乎 - 没问题了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Remember, we care. - You're good to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.94,0:08:07.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,请记住 我们在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}And just remember, we care.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.15,0:08:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到标着高级扩展功能的图标\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look for the icon marked advanced extensions.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.36,0:08:12.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 - 点击它\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - Click on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.86,0:08:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪个图标 哪个 太多了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which icon? Which one? There's a bunch…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.82,0:08:16.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 从左数第十三个图标 - 谁的左边\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thirteenth icon from the left. - Whose left?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.08,0:08:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的左边 - 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your left. - Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.58,0:08:22.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我找到了 - 好 找到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I got it now. - Okay, got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.83,0:08:23.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.82,0:08:25.08,Note,0,0,0,0,,（正在追踪新的异常物体 命名为2019-AMRJ）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.08,0:08:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you still there?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.88,0:08:28.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在吗 帮帮我 怎么回事 - 没事 没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello? Help. What's going on? - Oh, no. Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.09,0:08:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这边运行一个小小的诊断程序\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me just run a little diagnostic on my end,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.76,0:08:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后再回复你 不不不 用不了多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I will be right back to you. No, no, no, it won't take long.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.26,0:08:34.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快的 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not long at all. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.72,0:08:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么搞的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the f…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.39,0:08:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 令人费解 - 这是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is perplexing. - Is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.60,0:08:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.15,0:08:47.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,外星人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A-l-i-e-n-s?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.81,0:08:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白你为什么非得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know why you always insist.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.19,0:08:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,既小声又拆开说\N{\fnArial\fs30}on whispering and spelling that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.82,0:08:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,终于决定要露面了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finally decided to show up, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.61,0:08:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.07,0:08:59.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只需要搞清楚轨迹 就能打入内部了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I have to do is figure out trajectory, and I am in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.66,0:09:02.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回来了 好了 试试这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm back. Okay, try this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.54,0:09:04.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拔掉电源 再插回去 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Unplug it, plug it back in. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.33,0:09:06.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,请记住 我们在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}And remember, we care.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.80,0:09:13.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.09,0:09:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉米要回来找孩子们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jimmy's coming back to get the kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.80,0:09:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.85,0:09:27.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 来看看现在你在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Let's see where you are now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.43,0:09:29.55,Note,0,0,0,0,,（国家宇航局）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.56,0:09:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎回来 阿米塔奇教授\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome back, Professor Armitage.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.61,0:09:38.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个狡猾的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tricky one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.03,0:09:40.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该不是流星吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think you're a meteor after all, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.53,0:09:45.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我觉得你是未经许可的到来者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope, I think you are an unauthorized landing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.00,0:09:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.58,0:09:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,终于等到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.07,0:09:57.26,Note,0,0,0,0,,（世界新闻日报 外星人前任吉米说 「我会回来的 宝贝」）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.92,0:09:53.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,稍后见 吉米\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you soon, Jimmy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.18,0:10:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在这停 就在这停\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right here, right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.10,0:10:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在这停\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.90,0:10:12.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,请别停表\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please keep the meter running.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.15,0:10:14.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我加钱给你 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll pay you extra. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.02,0:10:30.77,Note,0,0,0,0,,（危险 高压电围栏 五万伏）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.46,0:11:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,对对对 拜托 吉米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah, yeah. Come on, Jimmy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.63,0:11:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你回地球干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing back on Earth?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.39,0:11:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是…这里是地球吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is… This is Earth?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.80,0:11:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我搞错了 伙计们 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}My bad, guys. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.26,0:11:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,回总部跟O说去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell it to O back at HQ.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.68,0:11:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想见我的孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want to see my kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.93,0:11:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这艘飞船弄走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get this ship out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.68,0:11:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把这位赞波利安朋友带回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll escort our Zamporian friend back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.33,0:11:46.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别跟丢了 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't lose them. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.91,0:11:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我这就追 - 快追 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm on it. On it. - Go, go, go. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.40,0:12:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们把那个赞波利安人带回来了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did they bring in that Zamporian yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.32,0:12:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,比你早到了几分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Came in a couple of minutes ahead of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.11,0:12:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那家伙想借着英仙座流星雨的掩护溜进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The guy tried to sneak in behind a Perseid meteor shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.62,0:12:27.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,太业余了 我说得对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amateur hour. Am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.91,0:12:29.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,千真万确\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right as rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.12,0:12:32.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不打幌子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rain don't lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.09,0:12:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天 还说什么业余\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sheesh, talk about amateur hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.38,0:12:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不上报吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna call this in, or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.51,0:12:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑色警报\N{\fnArial\fs30}Code Black.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.61,0:12:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,未经许可的访客\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unauthorized visitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.86,0:13:01.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,封锁协议倒计时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lockdown protocol engaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.15,0:13:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,三 二 一\N{\fnArial\fs30}in three, two, one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.74,0:13:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 她为谁工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, who's she working for?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.20,0:13:13.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,她声称是独自工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}She claims to be working alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.62,0:13:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个平民碰巧大摇大摆地\N{\fnArial\fs30}A random civilian simply waltzes in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.87,0:13:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,从大街上走进来了 我才不信\N{\fnArial\fs30}off the high street. I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.57,0:13:21.04,Note,0,0,0,0,,（联邦调查局 华盛顿外勤办事处 培训探员申请表 莫莉·莱特）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.30,0:13:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,消除她的记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neuralyze her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.84,0:13:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.97,0:13:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这东西是干什么的 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what that thing is. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.60,0:13:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on. Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.35,0:13:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,她有过经历\N{\fnArial\fs30}She had an experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.15,0:13:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,它消除了我父母的记忆 却没消除我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It erased my parents' memories, but it didn't take mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.61,0:13:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以从小到大 所有人都说我疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So my whole life, everyone's called me crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.95,0:13:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说我需要治疗\N{\fnArial\fs30}They said that I needed therapy,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.40,0:13:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我承认我确实需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}which, okay, admittedly, I did,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.32,0:13:50.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不是因为这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}but not for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.33,0:13:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,她真的黑进了哈勃望远镜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did she really hack into the Hubble Telescope.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.33,0:13:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,来观测仙女座II 而我们却没逮到她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}to look at Andromeda II, and we didn't catch her?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.12,0:13:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果是以前 我们还会聘用她\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the old days, we'd have hired her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.00,0:14:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我花了差不多二十年时间找到你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}It took me 20 years to find you, plus or minus.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.09,0:14:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,有几个人能这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many people can say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.84,0:14:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.61,0:14:23.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找到我们了 你证明了自己没疯\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you found us. You proved you're not crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.19,0:14:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你颁一枚正常人徽章 然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You win the I'm Not Crazy badge. Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.28,0:14:27.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想加入 - 我们不招聘 只招募\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I want in. - We don't hire. We recruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.65,0:14:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我想让你们招募我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I'd like to be recruited.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.99,0:14:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样可不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to need more.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.87,0:14:36.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过你能给我一个说得过去的理由吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But would you mind giving me one good reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.62,0:14:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我很聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I'm smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.29,0:14:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,很有动力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm motivated.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.33,0:14:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我穿黑色很好看 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I look good in black. I'm…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.34,0:14:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,很无趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boring me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.34,0:14:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我完全没有个人生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I have absolutely no life whatsoever.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.97,0:14:51.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一无所有 没有狗 没有猫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have nothing. I have no dog, no cat,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.55,0:14:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,淡定不下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}definitely no chill.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.80,0:14:55.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有任何值得留恋的事物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have nothing that I couldn't happily walk away from,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.27,0:14:57.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我非常适合这份工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}which makes me perfect for this job.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.60,0:15:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是太可悲了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you're certainly suitably tragic.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.69,0:15:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有爱 没有人际关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}No love? No relationships?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.52,0:15:05.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些只会分散你对重要的事的注意力\N{\fnArial\fs30}They just distract you from what's important.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.40,0:15:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 那什么是重要的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? And what's important?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.15,0:15:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,宇宙的真谛\N{\fnArial\fs30}The truth of the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.16,0:15:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想知道一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna know everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.70,0:15:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想知道宇宙的运作方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna know how it all works.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.91,0:15:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的认为黑色套装\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really think a black suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.75,0:15:20.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,能解决你所有的问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}is going to solve all your problems?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.08,0:15:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能 但你穿起来就非常好看\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, but it looks damn good on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.67,0:15:26.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这倒是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.15,0:15:36.74,Note,0,0,0,0,,（训练第一周 探员 莫莉·莱特）
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.20,0:15:43.64,Note,0,0,0,0,,（录用）
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.65,0:15:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,从现在起\N{\fnArial\fs30}From this moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.48,0:15:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要遵从我们给你安排的身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}you will conform to the identity we give you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.65,0:15:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只能穿着黑衣人特勤队的服装\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will dress only in MIB Special Services attire.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.95,0:15:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经接受了黑衣人认可的技术\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have been trained in the use of MIB-sanctioned technology,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.91,0:16:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,车辆及武器的培训\N{\fnArial\fs30}vehicles and weaponry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.63,0:16:06.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何情况下 你都不可以引人注目\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will not stand out in any way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.59,0:16:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,体制中再也没有你这个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are no longer part of the system.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.80,0:16:17.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本不存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do not exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.64,0:16:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,结账 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.10,0:16:20.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们凌驾于体制之上\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are above the system.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.73,0:16:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,超越体制 我们就是体制\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over it, beyond it. We are them. We are they.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.77,0:16:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是黑衣人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are the Men in Black.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.52,0:16:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑衣「男人」吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The "Men" in Black?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.19,0:16:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 别提这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't. Don't start.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.98,0:16:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟他们谈过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've had the conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.82,0:16:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们似乎无法放弃这个名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}They didn't seem to be able to let it go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.65,0:16:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个过程 依恋的问题吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a process. Attachment issue, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.99,0:16:35.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的第一个任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's your first assignment.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.53,0:16:38.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我什么能拿到…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. When do I get my…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.95,0:16:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,那叫记忆消除器\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's called a neuralyzer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.25,0:16:42.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是随便就能拿到的 要通过努力争取\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you don't just get it, you earn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.04,0:16:45.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只是作为试用探员被录用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been accepted for a probationary period.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.88,0:16:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好表现 我们再考虑消除器的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Impress me, and we'll see about the bzzz.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.80,0:16:49.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.90,0:16:51.84,Note,0,0,0,0,,（试用期 黑衣人伦敦分部）
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.84,0:16:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜欢追求真相 不是吗 探员M\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a fan of the truth, aren't you, Agent M?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.72,0:16:55.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.89,0:16:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,伦敦分部好像有麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we may have a problem in London.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.66,0:17:03.16,Note,0,0,0,0,,（伦敦）
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.73,0:17:11.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这酒还真是顺口\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is smooth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.48,0:17:12.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续上 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's keep them coming, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.74,0:17:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来一杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another round.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.41,0:17:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想说我很喜欢这个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}So can I just say how much I'm liking this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.32,0:17:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,有条理 但又不会太古板\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's formal, but not too stuffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.29,0:17:22.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,很传统 但却还是有范\N{\fnArial\fs30}Classic, but still kind of stylish.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.79,0:17:25.77,Title,0,0,0,0,,很有《大开眼戒》的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Makes it a very Eyes Wide Shut kind of vibe.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.08,0:17:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说笑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.50,0:17:28.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,算是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sort of.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.05,0:17:36.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者只是致命的高风险赌博的效果\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or is it mostly just the lethal high-stakes gambling?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.97,0:17:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.30,0:17:41.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们看 王牌送上门 先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you look at that? Straight to the ace, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.35,0:17:42.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,又是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.39,0:17:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们谈谈正事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's talk business, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.27,0:17:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以卖这东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can move this stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.36,0:17:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想大量进货 应该找谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who do I speak with about getting a whole lot more of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.48,0:17:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我想加入\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.65,0:17:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能加入\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.57,0:17:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有一条非常严格的政策\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, I have a very strict.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.28,0:17:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,「不得与黑衣人交易」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"no Men in Black" policy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.07,0:18:01.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.45,0:18:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不怪你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't blame you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.70,0:18:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁会想让那些混蛋进来插一脚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who'd want those assholes coming in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.79,0:18:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑衣人 要我说他们是黑衣蠢货\N{\fnArial\fs30}Men in Black. The Morons in Black, if you ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.92,0:18:09.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,一群傻逼 我没说错吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a bunch of dicks. Am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.79,0:18:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,一粒老鼠屎就能毁掉一锅汤…\N{\fnArial\fs30}All it takes is one bad apple to spoil any environment…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.47,0:18:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位别动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.90,0:18:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是黑衣人 你个切鲁败类\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am MIB, you Cerulian scum.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.87,0:18:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要说 你这个小俱乐部烂透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And FYI, your little club here sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.08,0:18:46.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要从实招来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna give me everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.79,0:18:49.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,供应商 卖家 你的整个分销网\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suppliers, sellers, your whole network.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.38,0:18:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的好运耗尽了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your luck run out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.76,0:18:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're already dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.97,0:19:05.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里只有一个人有解药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only one person here has the antidote.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.31,0:19:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾米丽 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Emily, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.07,0:19:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 你要什么我都给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, I'll… I'll give you whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.66,0:19:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 什么都行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. Anything you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.24,0:19:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything I want?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.21,0:20:12.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,开往伦敦的特快列车已到站\N{\fnArial\fs30}The express train to London has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.04,0:20:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们将继续开往巴黎 斯德哥尔摩\N{\fnArial\fs30}With continuing service to Paris, Stockholm,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.84,0:20:19.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,米兰 罗马 马德里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Milan, Rome, Madrid.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.97,0:20:23.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,在更衣室逮到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caught him in the locker room.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.14,0:20:25.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道那孩子对自己用了记忆消除器\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew that kid was neuralyzing himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.56,0:20:28.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟他说 「用太多次会瞎的」\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told him, "Do that too much, and you'll go blind."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.85,0:20:29.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.93,0:20:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人想来点零嘴吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who could go for a nosh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.10,0:20:33.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想来个熏牛肉三明治\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like a nice pastrami sandwich.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.77,0:20:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,要加很多融化的奶酪\N{\fnArial\fs30}With lots of melted cheese.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.76,0:21:40.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,来自纽约的特快列车即将到站\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now arriving, express train from New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.64,0:21:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后一次通知 飞往猫眼星云的2112航班即将起飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last call for Flight 2112 to the Cat's Eye Nebula.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.32,0:21:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎 探员M\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome, Agent M.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.99,0:22:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,请前往新探员说明会报到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please report to New Agent Orientation.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.71,0:22:11.38,Note,0,0,0,0,,（踏上）
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.67,0:22:12.63,Note,0,0,0,0,,（处理中）
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.63,0:22:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,准许进入 探员M\N{\fnArial\fs30}Access granted, Agent M.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.52,0:22:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,每小时一班 12号登机口\N{\fnArial\fs30}…every hour from Gate 12.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.74,0:22:41.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,借过 女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.49,0:22:44.91,Note,0,0,0,0,,（外星人监视系统）
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.91,0:22:50.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,总是出乎意料\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's never who you think it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.21,0:22:53.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这个完全说得通\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. That one makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.80,0:22:57.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到我们的人就是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're the one who found us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.67,0:23:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.51,0:23:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是T 老大T\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm T. High T.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.85,0:23:04.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. You're…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.51,0:23:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是这个马戏团的老大 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I run this little circus. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.77,0:23:07.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎你 M\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome, M.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.43,0:23:09.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴认识你 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nice to meet you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.73,0:23:12.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,O告诉我新人值得期待\N{\fnArial\fs30}O told me to expect some great things.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.36,0:23:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不会失望的 - 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And great things shall you get. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.23,0:23:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,往那边走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right through there.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.16,0:23:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.12,0:23:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 等等 别碰他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait! Don't touch him!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.12,0:23:30.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.79,0:23:35.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我抓到他了 你们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got him, I got him. You guys…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.46,0:23:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我抓到他了 我抓到他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got him. I got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.19,0:23:49.82,Note,0,0,0,0,,（光年之旅 始于脚下 老大T）
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.54,0:24:04.91,Note,0,0,0,0,,（马拉喀什）
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.94,0:24:36.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,跳闸了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.99,0:24:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,去修一下
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.54,0:24:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就去付电费
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.80,0:25:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,修一下 修一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Change it, change it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.02,0:25:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.36,0:25:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,来试试这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Drink this.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.45,0:26:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点 弄坏了就要付钱买\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful. You break it, you buy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.96,0:26:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们留着吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep it. Keep it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.13,0:26:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,送你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}On me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.09,0:26:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要见女王\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to see the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.43,0:26:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.77,0:26:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,有访客\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have visitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.99,0:26:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,向女王禀报你们的来意\N{\fnArial\fs30}State your business with the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.99,0:26:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要一个人死\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need someone to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.13,0:27:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,仙女座II条约第6C条明确指出\N{\fnArial\fs30}As clearly stated in Section 6C of the Treaty of Andromeda II,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.13,0:27:07.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不杀加贝边人\N{\fnArial\fs30}we do not kill Jababians.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.59,0:27:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不会参与谋杀行径\N{\fnArial\fs30}nor participate in the murder thereof.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.09,0:27:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有商量余地\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is nonnegotiable.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.10,0:27:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 有一点商量余地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's slightly negotiable.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.12,0:27:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,早\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.58,0:27:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想找一台又旧又破的废物机器\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in the market for a useless, old, broken-down machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.08,0:27:40.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.08,0:27:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别想惹我生气 H\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not gonna get a rise out of me, H.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.21,0:27:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,有红色跳格键的帝国打字机\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the Imperial with the red tab.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.17,0:27:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,别落后好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do try to keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.13,0:27:48.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.77,0:27:59.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是以前的传送门站\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the old portal depot.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.77,0:28:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一次大型外星人移民的现场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Site of the First Great Alien Migration.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.98,0:28:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 埃菲尔是黑衣人探员吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, so Eiffel was an MIB agent?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.23,0:28:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,首批探员之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of the first.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.40,0:28:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他帮助了很多来地球\N{\fnArial\fs30}He helped so many intergalactic refugees.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.78,0:28:10.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,寻求庇护的星际难民\N{\fnArial\fs30}seeking protection here on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.65,0:28:11.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你仔细看\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you look closely,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.65,0:28:14.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能看到我的祖父母也在照片中\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can see my grandma and my grandpa in that picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.45,0:28:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,真美\N{\fnArial\fs30}So beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.83,0:28:18.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 给你 亲爱的 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here you are, dear. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.01,0:28:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那家伙是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up with that guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.98,0:28:49.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,内尔琳恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nerlene!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.32,0:28:51.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.19,0:28:53.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他实在是太诱人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's just so yummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.61,0:28:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他是谁 - H\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who is he? - H.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.07,0:28:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这栋楼里最优秀的探员而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only the best agent in the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.95,0:29:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他曾经仅用他的智慧和七系原子枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}He saved the world once with nothing but his wits.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.41,0:29:02.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,就拯救了世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a Series-7 De-Atomizer.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.16,0:29:04.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他拯救过世界吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He saved the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.21,0:29:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,从谁手上拯救的\N{\fnArial\fs30}From what?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.33,0:29:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜂兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Hive.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.96,0:29:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜂兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Hive.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.59,0:29:12.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 帮我个忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Guy, do me a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.84,0:29:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 帮我处理来电 - 乐意之至\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Handle my calls. - Oh, love to.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.22,0:29:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.14,0:29:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,去做点调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}To do some homework.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.35,0:29:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,马拉喀什发生了一起非常可怕的事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}An awful, terrible incident in Marrakesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.10,0:29:27.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,北非办事处正在调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}The North Africa office is investigating.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.90,0:29:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,至于其它事宜\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in other business,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.23,0:29:32.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,H终于决定大驾光临了\N{\fnArial\fs30}H has decided to grace us with his presence after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.65,0:29:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologies, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.44,0:29:34.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我昨天工作到很晚 大家早上好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was working late. Morning, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.61,0:29:36.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是 其实是在收拾你的烂摊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}So was I. Actually cleaning up after your mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.53,0:29:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.16,0:29:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该瞧瞧我今天早上收拾的烂摊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should've seen the mess I was cleaning up this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.12,0:29:42.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这完全是未经批准的行动 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a totally unsanctioned op, sir,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.04,0:29:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要两支控制小队和一整支记忆消除小组\N{\fnArial\fs30}requiring two containment units and a full neuralyzer squad.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.04,0:29:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I doubt that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.25,0:29:48.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我更想从宏观的角度来看待这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I prefer to look at this from a macro point of view,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.25,0:29:49.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要太纠结于细节\N{\fnArial\fs30}not get bogged in the details.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.75,0:29:51.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正坏人死了 所以嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bad guy's dead, so, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.42,0:29:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,请坐 最后一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a seat, please. One last item.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.42,0:29:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,一位加贝边王室成员\N{\fnArial\fs30}A member of the Jababian royal family.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.01,0:30:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,在前往半人马座A星途中要作停留\N{\fnArial\fs30}has a layover on his way to Centaurus A.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.35,0:30:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,丑八怪万格斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vungus the Ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.06,0:30:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,继承了头衔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inherited the title.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.77,0:30:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,信不信由你 万格斯其实是个美男子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe it or not, Vungus here is the looker in the crowd.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.61,0:30:11.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,全息影像总会让人重九斤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holograms always add 10 pounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.48,0:30:16.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,加贝边社会不允许某些言行失仪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jababian society doesn't allow for certain indiscretions.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.07,0:30:18.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,简而言之 他想玩得开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}In short, he wants to be shown a good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.53,0:30:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以拒绝 但加贝边人的采矿船\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could say no, but Jababian mining vessels.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.66,0:30:25.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,会把我们碾成银河系的星尘\N{\fnArial\fs30}would grind us into galactic dust.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.45,0:30:27.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 这有点讽刺 想想我们过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some irony there, sir, if you think that we used to, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.21,0:30:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是保护地球免受宇宙中的人渣侵扰\N{\fnArial\fs30}protect the Earth from the scum of the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.04,0:30:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在看起来我们是在保护人渣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now it seems we're protecting the scum.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.75,0:30:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 正是因为如此 这事很适合你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, that's why it would be right up your street.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.51,0:30:35.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的那杯茶 H\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your cup of tea, H.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.26,0:30:38.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识万格斯 他其实不怎么喝茶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I know Vungus. He doesn't really drink tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.34,0:30:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他更爱伏特加 龙舌兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}He prefers vodka, tequila,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.14,0:30:42.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,免洗洗手液 有时候三种一起喝\N{\fnArial\fs30}hand sanitizer, sometimes all at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.01,0:30:43.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一回我们在曼谷醒来 被铐在一匹马上…\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is one time, we woke up in Bangkok, handcuffed to a horse…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.93,0:30:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- H - 安静\N{\fnArial\fs30}- H? - Pipe down.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.43,0:30:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 抱歉 真心抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Sorry. Sincere apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.18,0:30:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来当他的保护人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will be his chaperone.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.81,0:30:51.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上 他特别要求找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, he specifically asked for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.19,0:30:53.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 没问题 希望我们最后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Absolutely, hopefully we don't end up.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.07,0:30:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会再被铐在马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}handcuffed to a horse again, heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.90,0:30:55.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.73,0:30:56.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,午夜前我会送他回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll have him home by midnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.03,0:30:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就太好了 真是好孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good boy. If you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.53,0:31:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,「那就太好了 真是好孩子」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Good boy. If you will."
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.91,0:31:02.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想他说的是「好男儿」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Good man, " I think he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.99,0:31:03.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,要让爸爸开心是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep Daddy happy, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.95,0:31:05.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我们就是这么铁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. We're like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.16,0:31:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把爸比照顾得真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look after Papi so well.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.04,0:31:08.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不是很嫉妒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're so jealous, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.29,0:31:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸比漂亮的小男孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Papi's little fancy boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.50,0:31:10.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也想要个爸比\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wish you had a papi.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.88,0:31:14.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们乘坐交通工具到达…\N{\fnArial\fs30}They came in on transportation…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.60,0:31:26.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.69,0:31:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oops.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.81,0:31:33.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抱歉 - 你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry. - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.94,0:31:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是醒着的 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope, I'm awake. It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.40,0:31:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是在赶着做我的每日冥想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just catching up on my daily meditation.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.11,0:31:40.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直想尝试\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have been meaning to try that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.86,0:31:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有读过 它能显著地提高\N{\fnArial\fs30}I read that it dramatically improves.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.20,0:31:43.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,线粒体的能量产生\N{\fnArial\fs30}mitochondrial energy production.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.62,0:31:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 是的 绝对可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep, yep. It… It absolutely does.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.20,0:31:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的线粒体能量已经爆棚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mitochondrial energy's through the roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.71,0:31:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们见过吗 - 没有 我是探员M\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Have we met before? - No. Agent M.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.25,0:31:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说你今晚要去见万格斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard you were on the Vungus meet tonight,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.00,0:31:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想为你提供帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I wanted to offer assistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.71,0:31:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个加贝边迷妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a bit of a Jababian wonk.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.55,0:32:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,语言 文化 政治 时尚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Language, culture, politics, fashion.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.47,0:32:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之 我编写了一份档案供你阅读\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyways, I compiled a dossier for you to read.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.18,0:32:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,档案 我喜欢好档案\N{\fnArial\fs30}A dossier. I love a good dossier.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.06,0:32:09.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是…你去打听一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}The thing is… Ask around.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.02,0:32:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是单干的 大家都知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I work alone. Ask anyone around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.64,0:32:14.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道加贝边人是能预测未知的读心者吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you know that Jababians are claircognizant empaths,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.23,0:32:16.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说他们可以读你的大脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}which means they can basically read your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.23,0:32:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有你的牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.82,0:32:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不过他们会露出马脚 - 什么马脚\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, they do have a tell. - What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.53,0:32:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们胳膊内侧的皮下斑点会改变颜色\N{\fnArial\fs30}Subdermal spots on the underside of their arms change color.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.62,0:32:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴知道这个 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good to know. But,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.53,0:32:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你的提议 我不需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}thank you for your offer. I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.58,0:32:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Message understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.41,0:32:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不打扰你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will leave you to your…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.33,0:32:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,冥想了\N{\fnArial\fs30}meditation.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.58,0:32:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.42,0:32:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道你的马脚是什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know what your tell is?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.55,0:32:40.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你冥想的时候会打呼噜\N{\fnArial\fs30}You snore when you meditate.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.43,0:32:51.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实转念一想 也许我需要一个后援\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, on second thought, maybe I could use some backup.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.46,0:33:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在想 这次行动我可以负责监控外围\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I was thinking, for the op, I can take the perimeter,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.05,0:33:26.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你负责接近万格斯 - 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and you make the approach to Vungus. - Yes, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.30,0:33:28.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是 在这一家俱乐部里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The thing is, with this particular club,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.68,0:33:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都想按自己的喜好来\N{\fnArial\fs30}everybody just wants to do their own thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.60,0:33:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,外星人想看起来像人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, the aliens wanna look like humans,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.10,0:33:34.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类想看起来像外星人\N{\fnArial\fs30}humans wanna look like aliens,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.39,0:33:35.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们可能需要放松一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}so we may need to loosen up a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.85,0:33:38.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我们先把领带解掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we lose the tie first, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.73,0:33:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,解开几粒扣子 别看着那么死板\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pop a couple of buttons and not look so stiff.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.61,0:33:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不想广而告之自己的身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't want to advertise our profession,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.95,0:33:46.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你明白我意思的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you know what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.07,0:33:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,「快看 是黑衣人 外星人 趴下」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Look! It's the Men in Black. Aliens, get down!"
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.70,0:33:50.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不要那样 - 我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't do that. - Yeah, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.03,0:33:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白吗 很好 非常好 我看起来怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? Good. Great. Perfect. How about me? How do I look?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.37,0:33:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would just, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.04,0:33:59.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你介意我… - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you mind if I… - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.29,0:33:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coming in.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.38,0:34:02.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,关键在于拿捏介于俱乐部休闲风\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think as it's a fine line between club casual.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.76,0:34:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,和地球上最悲惨男人之间的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the saddest man on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.26,0:34:04.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.55,0:34:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.18,0:34:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为我们已经到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought that we were here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.05,0:34:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,是到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.93,0:34:12.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,特别来宾入口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Entrance for special guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.48,0:34:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,踩油门吧 弗雷迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Step on it, would you, Freddie?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.40,0:34:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题 H\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got it, H.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.86,0:34:29.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 这可没想到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, okay. Wasn't expecting that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.38,0:34:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,万格斯大驾光临\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Vungus among us!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.39,0:34:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,H氢弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}H-Bomb!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.51,0:34:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,万哥 万哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}V-go! V-go!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.85,0:34:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧瞧你 你瘦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at you. You've lost weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.14,0:35:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的头发怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have you done to your hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.02,0:35:02.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你换了发型 看起来好棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've changed it. Looks fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.06,0:35:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我… - 我差点没认出来你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I… - I barely recognize you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.90,0:35:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 M 这是万格斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. M, this is Vungus.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.53,0:35:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,万格斯 这是M\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vungus, M.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.53,0:35:10.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 M\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, M.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.66,0:35:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴认识你\N{\fnArial\fs30}So nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.41,0:35:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说了你的好多事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've heard a lot about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.29,0:35:16.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了 我只挑好话说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Highly redacted, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.71,0:35:29.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,真会说话 他说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such a charmer. He says…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.88,0:35:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他觉得你很辣\N{\fnArial\fs30}he thinks you're hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.05,0:35:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他觉得我很什么 不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}He thinks I'm what? Sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.55,0:35:33.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然这只是大概的翻译\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a rough translation, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.89,0:35:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能用加贝边语说更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably works better on Ja… Jababia,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.72,0:35:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你明白的 因为你的加贝边语很流利\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you know that, since you speak fluent Jababian.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.10,0:35:44.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 我只是想找合适的词来表达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course. I was just trying to find the words to articulate.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.06,0:35:46.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有多不可思议地光彩夺目\N{\fnArial\fs30}how incredibly eye-catching you yourself are.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.86,0:35:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他正是如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.11,0:35:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,M对加贝边无所不知\N{\fnArial\fs30}M knows everything there's to know about Jababia.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.36,0:35:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会说自己「无所不知」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I wouldn't say "everything."
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.24,0:35:53.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,学无止境\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's always more to learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.41,0:35:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是她的癖好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like a fetish.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.03,0:35:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这话说得好像和性有关似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, that implies something sexual.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.70,0:35:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 绝对不是的 - 不 就是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's definitely not. - No, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.08,0:35:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总是「加贝边这个」\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's always like, "Oh, Jababia this,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.96,0:36:01.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,「加贝边那个 加贝边 加贝边」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jababia that, Jababia, Jababia, Jababia!"
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.79,0:36:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.25,0:36:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,看吧 我就知道你们俩合得来\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, I knew the two of you would hit it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.04,0:36:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,去跳舞吧 M很爱跳舞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have a dance, okay? M loves to dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.88,0:36:08.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,她跳舞很厉害 我去拿点酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's a wonderful dancer. I'll get some drinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.76,0:36:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是喜欢蔓越莓伏特加吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're still a vodka cranberry guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.76,0:36:11.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.18,0:36:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.22,0:36:15.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,M 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}M, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.89,0:36:17.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,来坐在万格斯旁边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come, sit next to Vungus.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.18,0:36:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证我不会咬人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise, I don't bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.31,0:36:21.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 等我一小会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, just give me one sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.27,0:36:24.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我们四杯蔓越莓伏特加\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get us four vodka cranberries.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.23,0:36:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的 我来买单\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right. I'll get this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.69,0:36:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,用公司的卡结账\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put it on the company card.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.90,0:36:28.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你个小提示 什么都用公款\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little tip, expense everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.57,0:36:30.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个小问题 没什么大不了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quick question, no big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.15,0:36:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是要给我和万格斯拉皮条吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you pimping me out to Vungus?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.74,0:36:33.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.86,0:36:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么会有这种想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell would give you that… impression?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.24,0:36:38.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.95,0:36:40.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 因为那个吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. That?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.75,0:36:42.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好不要看那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better not look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.29,0:36:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想让我当外星人诱饵\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you wanna use me as alien bait,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.04,0:36:46.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次先让我知道 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}just let me know next time, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.29,0:36:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想被欺骗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like to be lied to.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.50,0:36:49.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 就像假装是一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? What, like pretending to be an expert.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.46,0:36:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你并不擅长领域的专家吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}in something you're not?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.51,0:36:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你还没意识到 干这行就是撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}In case you haven't noticed, we're in the lying business.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.30,0:36:55.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吗 - 加贝边人很难搞\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are we? - Jababians are prickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.64,0:36:57.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们想让他们开心 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We want them to be happy, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.01,0:36:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样他们就不会把我们和地球一起毁灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}So they don't destroy our planet and everything on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.60,0:37:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that is the mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.97,0:37:03.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 如果你不能接受… - 我能接受任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}- If you're not down with… - I'm down with the mission,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.27,0:37:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不要和加贝边人乱搞\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'm not fornicating with the Jababian.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.60,0:37:06.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有要你那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not what I asked you to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.83,0:37:21.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这次来待多久 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how long you here for, buddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.29,0:37:23.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,万格斯明天回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vungus go home tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.96,0:37:24.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.29,0:37:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们最好尽情享受 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We better make it a good one, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.46,0:37:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来是有话要说 H 我们得聊聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came to talk, H. We need to speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.38,0:37:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,别聊了 来吧 我想看你跳舞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talky, shmalky. Come on, I want to see you dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.30,0:37:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 来吧 我知道这是你喜欢的节奏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on, I know, I know this is your jam.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.47,0:37:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,快过来 M 过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out here. M, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.76,0:37:42.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不了 我就坐着吧 我喜欢坐着跳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, I'm just gonna… I like to butt-dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.37,0:38:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,有件事我得跟你谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to talk to you about something.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.33,0:38:01.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想谈贝鲁特那晚的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it's about that night in Beirut,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.79,0:38:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,照片我已经删了 我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}I deleted the photos. Promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.87,0:38:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 不是贝鲁特\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not Beirut. Just…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.23,0:38:26.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 探员H - 什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- H? - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.31,0:38:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,十二点方向\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twelve o'clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.19,0:38:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的太对了 时间还早呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're damn right it is. Night is young.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.44,0:38:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 探员H\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me, H.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.48,0:38:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是认真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.53,0:38:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是万格斯唯一能信任的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the only one that Vungus can trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.94,0:38:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也信任你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, feeling's mutual.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.25,0:38:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么了 - 没怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What happened to you? - Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.17,0:38:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么突然这么严肃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you so serious all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.17,0:38:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 放轻松 - H\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Relax. - H.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.07,0:39:18.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right, buddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.86,0:39:20.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 你看起来不太好\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong? You don't look so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.41,0:39:22.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧 - 万格斯感觉不舒服\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You okay? - Vungus not feel so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.45,0:39:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,蔓越莓伏特加确实劲很大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vodka cranberry sure pack a punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.79,0:39:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们送他上车 离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get his car and get him out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.04,0:39:30.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 - 没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Yup. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.79,0:39:33.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 送你回去睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Get you off to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.84,0:39:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们送你上车 好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get you in here. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.25,0:39:38.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 伙计 进去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you are, buddy. In you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.42,0:39:40.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心头 好的 好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch your head. Okay. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.47,0:39:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好睡一觉 明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, sleep it off, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.76,0:39:43.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,明早再跟你聊 多喝水\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll speak to you in the morning. Hydrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.10,0:39:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们是不是应该上报 - 天呐 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shouldn't we call it in? - Oh, God, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.68,0:39:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,填文件简直是噩梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}The paperwork is a nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.27,0:39:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,但万格斯看起来不太好\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Vungus didn't look too good.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.06,0:39:54.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他之前看起来就不太好 但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't look too good before, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.11,0:39:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 我见过他更糟的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me, I've seen him way worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.77,0:39:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一次在伊斯坦布尔…\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one time in Istanbul…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.54,0:40:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.13,0:40:16.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 黑衣人 不许动 - 趴在地上\N{\fnArial\fs30}- MIB. Freeze! - On the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.30,0:40:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 手掌向下 - 手举起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Palms down. - Hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.68,0:40:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 手举起来 - 手掌向下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hands up. - Palms down.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.51,0:40:27.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想用哪个 我两个都行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which do you want to go with? I'm fine with either.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.47,0:40:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是觉得未来我们得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just think in the future we're gonna have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.77,0:40:30.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,统一指令 你想用手掌向下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}come up with something consistent. You want palms down?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.14,0:40:32.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不介意的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.19,0:40:34.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 手掌向下 - 手掌向下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Palms down. - Palms down.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.65,0:40:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.63,0:40:59.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.97,0:41:04.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可不妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.43,0:41:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.48,0:41:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,M\N{\fnArial\fs30}M!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.94,0:41:16.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.52,0:41:17.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,油箱盖 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Petrol cap. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.21,0:41:36.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要更强的火力 侧视镜\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need more firepower. Side-view mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.08,0:41:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想让我怎么办 拿这个砸他们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want me to do, throw it at them?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.56,0:41:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这我可没见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't seen that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.44,0:41:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得这个不管用\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think this is doing anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.52,0:42:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.53,0:42:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,排气管 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exhaust pipe. Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.66,0:42:05.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.08,0:42:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这还差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now this is more like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.50,0:42:13.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.72,0:42:20.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.94,0:42:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,去救万格斯 我掩护你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to Vungus. I'll cover you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.56,0:42:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,H 来搭把手\N{\fnArial\fs30}H! A little help here!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.27,0:42:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 别叫H\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Not H.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.07,0:42:38.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.07,0:42:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能感觉到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.49,0:42:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须确认\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to know…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.53,0:42:46.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,能否信任你\N{\fnArial\fs30}if I can trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.00,0:42:54.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下我生气了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I'm pissed off.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.63,0:42:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这个藏起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hide this.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.84,0:43:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑衣人内部不太对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something is wrong in Men in Black.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.67,0:43:04.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 万格斯 这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Vungus, what is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.21,0:43:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有这东西能保护你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the only thing that can protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.36,0:43:23.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.04,0:43:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们时髦的舞步去哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's your fancy dance moves now?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.19,0:43:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.65,0:43:59.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,盯紧了 不安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep your eyes on. It's not safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.07,0:44:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,盯紧了 盯紧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eyes on! Eyes on!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.10,0:44:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two targets!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.41,0:44:04.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.66,0:44:07.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.58,0:44:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 退后一点 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, back up a little bit, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.47,0:44:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你超越了自我了 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Outdone yourself here, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.60,0:44:34.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 做得好 做得好 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well done. Well done. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.27,0:44:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我说说 发生什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fill me in. What happened, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.52,0:44:38.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,很明显 我们遇袭了 C\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were attacked, clearly, C.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.44,0:44:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 - 对方不知是什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Right. - By I don't know what.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.69,0:44:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,嫌犯 这是他们徒手造成的伤害\N{\fnArial\fs30}The suspects, they did this with their bare hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.90,0:44:44.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们将固体变成液体\N{\fnArial\fs30}They turned solid into liquid,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.24,0:44:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 然后又变回去了 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- then back again. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.49,0:44:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她怎么在这里 - 她…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why's she here? - She…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.91,0:44:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她要… - 她要…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She is… - She is…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.78,0:44:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,为你讲解犯罪现场\N{\fnArial\fs30}walking you through the crime scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.49,0:44:54.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不行 她是试用探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. She is a probationary agent,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.75,0:44:57.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以她不能出现在这里 明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}so she is not here at all, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.67,0:45:00.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,很明显她现在就在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you'll find that she clearly is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.25,0:45:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我能看到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I can see her.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.71,0:45:02.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 支持你了 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Backing you up. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.05,0:45:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是一种说法 不过好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}A figure of speech, but fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.59,0:45:06.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你惹上大麻烦了 天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are in so much trouble, oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.51,0:45:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只有一个任务 非常简单的任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had one job. You had one very simple job:
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.68,0:45:12.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,带这个蜥蜴混球出去喝几杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}To take some lizard slimeball out for a few drinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.39,0:45:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就这么简单 - 不是「蜥蜴混球」\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That was it. - Not a "lizard slimeball."
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.52,0:45:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他是我的朋友 - 不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A friend of mine. - Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.52,0:45:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我说错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.81,0:45:19.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他生前是个爬虫混球\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a reptilian slimeball,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.82,0:45:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在因你而死\N{\fnArial\fs30}he is now dead because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.44,0:45:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他死的时候谁跟他在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who was with him when he died?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.40,0:45:23.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我 - 谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I was. - Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.28,0:45:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 他有没有说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, good. And did he say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.45,0:45:28.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,能够解释他被杀的理由的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}that might explain why he was killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.28,0:45:29.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都行 快说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything at all? Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.37,0:45:35.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 什么也没说\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Not a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.33,0:45:38.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我重新概括一下 - 没必要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So just to recap… - No point.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.63,0:45:40.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,加贝边皇室的一名高阶成员\N{\fnArial\fs30}A high-ranking member of the Jababian royal family.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.92,0:45:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你们的保护下死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}dies on your watch,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.25,0:45:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,袭击者你们识别不出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}murdered by assailants that you can't identify,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.63,0:45:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,谋杀的原因你们也说不上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}for reasons that you cannot begin to fathom.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.67,0:45:48.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这样吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that about right?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.13,0:45:51.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一开口我就自动屏蔽了 不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I switched off the moment you started talking. I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.01,0:45:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么还不滚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now why don't you bugger off.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.56,0:45:54.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 伙计 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, mate. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.06,0:45:55.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 - 这就滚\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - I'll piss off,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.23,0:45:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 回办事处 - 你属于那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Back to the office. - Where you belong.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.52,0:45:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,去跟老大T谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}To have a word with High T,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.31,0:46:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次他可救不了你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}who will not save you this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.32,0:46:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会没事的 好吗 别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be fine. Okay? Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.86,0:46:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个…我们会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is… We'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.45,0:46:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.65,0:46:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 是的 明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Yes. Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.70,0:46:14.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 的确\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah… Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.79,0:46:19.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.38,0:46:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.13,0:46:23.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.55,0:46:25.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（打败蜂兽 仅用他们的智慧和七系原子枪）
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.50,0:46:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向你保证 我们将以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me assure you, we will deal with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.42,0:46:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,最严厉的措辞处理此事\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the strongest possible terms.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.93,0:46:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,加贝边人想要你们的脑袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Jababians want your heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.27,0:46:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,字面意义 两颗头 用外交包裹邮寄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quite literally. Both heads, sent by diplomatic pouch.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.02,0:46:41.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 这个…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, um, ahem…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.77,0:46:43.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morning, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.38,0:46:46.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拿来了你要的法医报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have the forensics report that you asked for.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.86,0:46:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.65,0:46:50.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就有问题了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this is troubling.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.36,0:46:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very troubling.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.49,0:46:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们的嫌犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are our suspects.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.04,0:46:58.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,名叫幻影双煞的物种\N{\fnArial\fs30}A species called Dyadnum.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.37,0:47:03.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,来自天龙座的二元星系\N{\fnArial\fs30}From a binary star system in the constellation Draco.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.67,0:47:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,天龙座 那是蜂兽的领地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Draco, that's Hive territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.25,0:47:06.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,整个区域多年前就沦陷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The entire sector fell years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.13,0:47:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,幻影双煞的DNA\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Dyads' DNA…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.72,0:47:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,充斥着蜂兽的变异基因\N{\fnArial\fs30}are riddled with Hive mutations.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.68,0:47:16.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都知道 蜂兽不仅摧毁敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}As we all know, the Hive doesn't just destroy their enemies,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.22,0:47:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,还会将其吸收\N{\fnArial\fs30}they subsume them.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.43,0:47:19.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,从内部彻底掌控\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take them over from within.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.06,0:47:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管这两人是谁 他们都成为蜂兽的一部分了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever these two were, they're part of the Hive now.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.65,0:47:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 但只是杀一个加贝边皇室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, but why would the Hive send them all this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.73,0:47:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜂兽为什么要如此大费周章\N{\fnArial\fs30}to kill a Jababian royal?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.11,0:47:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你比任何人都更了解万格斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew Vungus better than anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.23,0:47:30.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有没有说过自己为什么来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he indicate why he was here?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.49,0:47:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想从我们这里得到什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he want something from us?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.92,0:47:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 他看起来挺正常挺开心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he seemed pretty normal, happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.57,0:47:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 整件事都一团糟 就是个烂摊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir. This whole thing is a fiasco. It's a farrago.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.01,0:47:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么重大的失败\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a failure of this magnitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.24,0:47:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要立即启用\N{\fnArial\fs30}requires immediate involvement of…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.42,0:47:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,第十三条\N{\fnArial\fs30}Article 13.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.63,0:47:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,别犯浑了 谁会说「烂摊子」这种词\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be a dick. Who says "farrago"?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.59,0:47:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,第十三条是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is Article 13?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.13,0:47:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,立即停职 接着消除记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Immediate termination, followed by neuralyzation.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.05,0:47:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等一下 - 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait a second. - Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.38,0:47:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不行 - 你们这些人只会这样处理问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Is that you people's answer to everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.51,0:47:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,快收起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put that away!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.30,0:47:58.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 摘掉眼镜 - 长官 你不能这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Glasses off. - Sir, you can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.18,0:48:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我一个不这么做的理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me one good reason why not.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.14,0:48:01.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because it's…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.14,0:48:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们之前谈过的\N{\fnArial\fs30}what we were talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.40,0:48:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 因为… - 因为…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Because… - Because…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.15,0:48:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你消除我们的记忆 就永远无法得知真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you erase us, you will never know the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.53,0:48:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真相 - 长官 他们显然在拖延时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The truth. - Come on, sir, they're obviously stalling.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.36,0:48:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你下令我就动手 - 收起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Say the word. I'll do it. - Put it away.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.61,0:48:16.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,M 继续 解释一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}M, go ahead. Explain yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.91,0:48:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, sir…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.29,0:48:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你认真想想 仔细想想\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you think about it, really think about it…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.33,0:48:25.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,万格斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vungus…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.63,0:48:28.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,有几个人知道他来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}how many people really knew that he was here?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.96,0:48:30.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有这个房间里的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The people in this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.42,0:48:33.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概还有十几个高级探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}And perhaps a dozen high-level agents.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.76,0:48:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果只有这些人知道万格斯会去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}If those were the only people that knew where Vungus would be,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.01,0:48:38.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且我们假设万格斯没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we assume that Vungus didn't leak.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.79,0:48:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,把自己的位置泄露给杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}his own location to the killers,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.64,0:48:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是不是意味着泄密的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}doesn't that mean that it was someone…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.48,0:48:44.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,在黑衣人内部\N{\fnArial\fs30}inside MIB?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.81,0:48:47.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,有内奸 长官 就在我们之间\N{\fnArial\fs30}A mole, sir, inside these very walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.15,0:48:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 他们很显然是现编的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, they're abviously making this up as they go along.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.48,0:48:50.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,胡说什么？「有内奸」？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about? "A mole"?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.86,0:48:53.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,组织成立以来从未有过泄密事件 还说「有内奸」\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the whole history of the company, there's never been a leak."A mole."
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.28,0:48:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这话像是内奸才会说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That sounds like something a mole would say.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.74,0:48:56.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别胡扯了 - 内奸经典语录\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't be absurd. - Classic mole talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.49,0:48:57.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来像是内奸初级教学\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like Mole 101.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.67,0:48:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.41,0:49:01.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们已经被渗透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we've been compromised,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.16,0:49:03.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那这个星球上的每位居民都处于危险之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}it puts every citizen on this planet,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.08,0:49:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类和外星人都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}both human and alien, at risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.38,0:49:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- C - 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- C. - Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.04,0:49:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,追踪这两个杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Track down these killers.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.46,0:49:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到杀手 我们就能揪出内奸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find the killers, we find the mole.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.84,0:49:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 长官 - 解散\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Will do, sir. - Dismissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.76,0:49:18.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,M 看起来你的确像自己说的那样聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}M, it appears you're as sharp as advertised.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.76,0:49:21.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,和C一起查这件案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Work the case with C.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.14,0:49:24.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,让武器部门研发能够\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get Weapons Department started on something.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.14,0:49:26.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,干掉幻影双煞的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}that can neutralize these Dyads.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.94,0:49:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.65,0:49:36.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的确很聪明 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sharp indeed she is, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.32,0:49:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你打算让我监督这个案子 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I assume you'll want me overseeing the case? Sort of…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.07,0:49:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,H 我再也不会为你打掩护了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm finished covering for you, H.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.78,0:49:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个案子你需要我 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need me on this case, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.08,0:49:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前跟蜂兽打过交道 记得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've dealt with the Hive before. Remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.54,0:49:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,仅用我的智慧和我的七系…\N{\fnArial\fs30}With nothing but my wits and my Series 7…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.58,0:49:51.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 是这个人跟蜂兽打过交道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. He dealt with the Hive before.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.88,0:49:54.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我不知道这个人现在跑去哪儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I don't know where the hell he has gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.34,0:49:57.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我过去真心认为你可以领导这个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I actually used to think you could lead this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.22,0:49:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看错你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was wrong about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.50,0:50:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,没你的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're done here.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.93,0:50:06.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's an order.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.09,0:50:11.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有看错我 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you weren't wrong about me, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.07,0:50:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你曾经在我身上看到的东西 仍旧在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saw something in me once. It's still there.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.11,0:50:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你失望了 我向你道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I apologize for letting you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.11,0:50:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,再给我一次机会 我会弥补过错的 我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me another chance and I'll fix this. I promise you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.84,0:50:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得不仅仅是个刀片\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think it's just a blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.40,0:50:36.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来上面还有毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like it carries some poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.67,0:50:37.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你什么意思 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what you're talking about. Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.98,0:50:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 兄弟 老大T决定了 他想要我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, mate. High T decided he wants me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.84,0:50:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 负责此案 - 等等 什么 不好意思 我不信\N{\fnArial\fs30}- to run point on this one. - Wait. What? Sorry, I don't believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.30,0:50:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也和你一样不满\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like it any better than you,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.60,0:50:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他一直说什么就靠我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he kept going on about relying on me,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.85,0:50:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要我们的顶尖探员 之类的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}needing our top agent, that sort of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.10,0:50:49.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我说了算 你找他说去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't make the rules. Take it up with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.75,0:50:52.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,M 他希望你跟我一起调查此案\N{\fnArial\fs30}M, he's keen for you to shadow me on this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.02,0:50:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说 「向最优秀的人学习」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Learn from the best, " he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.32,0:50:55.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你愿意的话 来点在职培训\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little on-the-job training, if you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.32,0:50:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.28,0:51:00.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要跟他走还是留下来 - 我跟他走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you going or you staying? - Yeah, I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.49,0:51:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧… - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, alright… - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.70,0:51:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来吧 - H\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. - H?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.58,0:51:07.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.96,0:51:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真受不了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sick of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.88,0:51:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.96,0:51:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所以实际情况是什么 - 你来告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So what's the actual truth? - Well, you tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.13,0:51:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为对讨厌撒谎的人来说 你的表现太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because for someone who hates lying, that was incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.42,0:51:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我没有… - 刚刚多刺激啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I wasn't… - Come on, it was electric up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.55,0:51:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们互相配合 你一句我一句\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way we played off each other, back and forth.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.55,0:51:24.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是临场发挥 - 黑衣人有内奸\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I was riffing. - A mole inside the MIB.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.64,0:51:26.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 太机智了 要是我自己能想出这一招就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}God. It's genius. I wish I thought of it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.22,0:51:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发现了一种可能性\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I discovered a possible truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.64,0:51:29.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想看 这能解释很多事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, think about it. It would explain a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.93,0:51:31.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前为止你掌握了些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what have you got so far?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.73,0:51:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我准备对这种物质做分子解构\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was about to run a molecular deconstruction on the substance.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.65,0:51:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后与所有毒素进行交叉对比\N{\fnArial\fs30}and cross-reference with all toxins.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.15,0:51:37.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好主意 - 简单的科学手段\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good idea. - Just a little science.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.98,0:51:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就不会这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.86,0:51:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.60,0:51:42.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 它杀死了一个136公斤的加贝边人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. That killed a 300-pound Jababian,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.38,0:51:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就不会拿它来玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I wouldn't get recreational with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.82,0:51:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是泽福斯 极高纯度\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Zephos, pure grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.37,0:51:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,剂量掌握不好能立刻致死\N{\fnArial\fs30}The wrong amount will kill you instantly.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.40,0:51:49.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,但恰好的剂量能让你在摩纳哥的夜店\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right amount will keep you dancing shirtless.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.37,0:51:51.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,脱掉上衣 狂舞整整十七个小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}on a nightclub in Monaco for about 17 hours straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.89,0:51:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,信息量太大了 总是那么大的信息量\N{\fnArial\fs30}So much information. Always so much information.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.67,0:51:56.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正我就是这么听说的 全世界只有一个地方的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what I've heard anyway. There's only one place in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.42,0:51:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道怎么调制它 我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}where they know how to mix it. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.76,0:52:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来吗 世界可不会拯救自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}You coming? World's not gonna save itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.11,0:52:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说你需要我去拯救世界吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you saying that you need me to save the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.52,0:52:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也这么觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought so.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.95,0:52:30.69,Note,0,0,0,0,,（马拉喀什）
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.34,0:52:41.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里经常会看到这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll see that a lot around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.67,0:52:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是克罗穆联标签\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a Cromulian tag.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.76,0:52:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他们的星系中 这是希望和湮灭的标志\N{\fnArial\fs30}In their galaxy, a symbol for hope or annihilation.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.51,0:52:50.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,至于到底是什么还存在争议\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's still some debate around what exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.68,0:52:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上 是和谐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, it's harmony.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.60,0:52:55.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,但在地球上 它意味着我们进入了黑衣人安全港\N{\fnArial\fs30}But on Earth, it means we're entering an MIB safe haven.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.14,0:52:57.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么知道的 - 手册里有说明\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How do you know? - It's in the handbook.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.69,0:52:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要全盘相信你读到的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't believe everything you read.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.90,0:53:00.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是我的工作 - 那我的工作是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That is my job. - And my job is what?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.86,0:53:01.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,无所事事 然后闭上嘴吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang out here and shut up?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.98,0:53:04.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 闭嘴 那就是你的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Shut up. That's your job.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.45,0:53:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这是谁 纳斯尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, look who it is. Nasr.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.24,0:53:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你清楚规矩的 公众场所禁止出现外星技术\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know the rules: no visible alien tech anywhere on the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.87,0:53:11.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,把摩托车遮起来 否则我要给你开罚单了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cover the bike up before I have to give you a ticket.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.00,0:53:15.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,H 真是你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}H? It is really you?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.62,0:53:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然是我了 不然还能是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course it's me. Who else could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.50,0:53:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 巴萨姆 你好 - H 你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, Bassam. - Hi, H.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.09,0:53:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳斯尔说你死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nasr said you were dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.42,0:53:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 我…我没有说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? I… I never said that.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.17,0:53:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说过 他在撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did. He's lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.63,0:53:26.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,放…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.86,0:53:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是… - 为什么说我死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's… - And why would I be dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.31,0:53:33.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴萨姆误解了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bassam misunderstood.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.39,0:53:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们听说你和瑞莎分手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We heard that you and Riza had split up.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.64,0:53:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞莎 那是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Riza. Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.06,0:53:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not important.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.47,0:53:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类 还是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Human or…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.65,0:53:42.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那不重要 - 我只是好奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Doesn't matter. - I'm just curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.08,0:53:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,跨物种是什么样的 所以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}how it works between species, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.72,0:53:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常不重要 只是我一个老朋友 所以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very unimportant. Old friend of mine, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.32,0:53:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的老朋友掌管着星系中最大的犯罪组织\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who runs the biggest criminal syndicate in the galaxy.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.16,0:53:52.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是一位十分成功的女商人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is a very successful businesswoman.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.03,0:53:53.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢女商人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love a businesswoman.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.06,0:53:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们为什么要谈这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, why are we talking about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.39,0:53:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,太令人悲伤了 你们俩特别般配\N{\fnArial\fs30}So sad. You made a lovely couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.60,0:53:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 但这种事很正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay thank you very much. But these things happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.37,0:54:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说 「那个神经病会割断他喉咙」\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said, "That psycho's gonna slit his throat."
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.19,0:54:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 失陪一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse us for one moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.26,0:54:06.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你说的 不是我 你难道没有…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your words, not mine. Don't you…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.17,0:54:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟那个人交往过 似乎有利益冲突啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You dated this person? Seems like a conflict of interest.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.39,0:54:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知晓我的私人生活才叫利益冲突\N{\fnArial\fs30}Conflict of interest for you to know my private life.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.60,0:54:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我也不想知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, sure. I'd prefer not to.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.06,0:54:15.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了 听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's enough. Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.14,0:54:16.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再暴揍他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop beating the hell out of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.81,0:54:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就是 - 把这东西遮好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Keep this thing covered up.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.44,0:54:19.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没问题 一定做到 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Absolutely. Will do. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.98,0:54:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会再犯错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Won't happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.52,0:54:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴认识你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice to meet you both.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.36,0:54:24.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.53,0:54:32.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.08,0:54:35.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,从夜店外的监控录像调出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pulled this from the surveillance camera outside the club.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.91,0:54:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你站在那 搞得我很不爽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Standing there, making me feel uncomfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.83,0:54:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.34,0:54:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个你拿给T看了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you shown this to T?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.09,0:54:47.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说所有事都要先告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said everything goes through you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.21,0:54:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 所有事都要先告诉我 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, everything does go through me. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.97,0:54:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会给他看的 你继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll show him. Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.64,0:54:56.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodness me.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.94,0:55:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.97,0:55:13.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻烦来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here comes trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.49,0:55:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.74,0:55:21.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在想我正在想的事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You thinking what I'm thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.12,0:55:22.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,打给瑞莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call Riza.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.05,0:55:26.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,到了 就是这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here. This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.18,0:55:33.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来像是有几天了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like a couple days' worth.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.39,0:55:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人出来取过\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one's been out to collect.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.85,0:55:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.67,0:56:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,再上前一步 我就把你的刘海液化了 小白脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}One more step and I'll liquefy your bangs, pretty boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.78,0:56:31.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别紧张 别紧张 - 好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Easy, easy. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.99,0:56:34.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们不想惹任何麻烦 - 别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We don't want any trouble. - Do not move.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.03,0:56:38.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.79,0:56:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该叫你什么 老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we call you, sport?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.12,0:56:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不能叫我「老兄」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Sport" is not what you call me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.46,0:56:44.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.42,0:56:46.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 「它」 他才对 - 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- "It"? He. - Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.54,0:56:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么要问该叫我什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would you call me anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.17,0:56:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,小兵没有姓名 我们就是小兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pawns don't have names. We're pawns.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.30,0:56:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那就叫「兵兵」吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay."Pawny, " then.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.54,0:56:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里发生什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened here?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.26,0:56:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们开了场最棒的派对\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had the best party.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.80,0:57:00.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,侃爷到场了 发布了一张新专辑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kanye showed up and dropped a whole new album.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.68,0:57:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他最得意的作品之一 你自己看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was some of his best work. Look around!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.85,0:57:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,明显是我们被袭击了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got our asses kicked!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.02,0:57:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,女王陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}My queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.77,0:57:11.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,她死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.57,0:57:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再也不会侍奉他人 我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll never serve another. I swear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.99,0:57:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我将用短剑刺入\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll plunge my dagger.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.57,0:57:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己的身体 就像这样 贯穿所有的重要脏器\N{\fnArial\fs30}into my own body, like this, through all my vital organs,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.07,0:57:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后就这样 等着黑暗带走我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then leave it until the dark takes me.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.41,0:57:26.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会真的打算这么做吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not gonna actually go through with this, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.67,0:57:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 失去了女王的小兵 只是一个小兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen. A queen's pawn without a queen is just a pawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.54,0:57:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,毫无价值\N{\fnArial\fs30}A nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.71,0:57:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须以最痛苦的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must end my own life.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.84,0:57:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,结束自己的生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the most painful way possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.01,0:57:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,别阻止我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.76,0:57:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,生存几率 零\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chance of survival: zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.02,0:57:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你觉得我们应该阻止他吗 - 马上就动手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you think we should stop him? - Gonna do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.07,0:57:47.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想看看他会不会做到底\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kinda wanna see if he goes through with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.94,0:57:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不好意思 你们说什么 - 什么都没说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry, what did you say? - Nothing at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.07,0:57:51.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗 我的确说话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? I did say something.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.65,0:57:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说了吗 - 是的 他是证人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You did? - Yeah. He's a witness.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.24,0:57:55.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.65,0:57:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得她不会希望你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I don't think that she would want you to,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.61,0:58:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的做到底 说真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know, go through with it, honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.70,0:58:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁 你怎么知道女王心中所想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you to know what a queen would or wouldn't want?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.33,0:58:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是一位女王吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you a queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.62,0:58:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,某种程度上来说所有女人都是女王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, to the extent that all women are, yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.25,0:58:11.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不是 我不是女王\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, no, no, I'm not a queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.79,0:58:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你知道她是什么吗 她是一位探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what she is, though, is an agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.71,0:58:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,「探员」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Agent"?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.42,0:58:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是一个头衔吗 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is that a title? - It is a title.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.34,0:58:21.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个象征着卓越地位的头衔\N{\fnArial\fs30}A title of great eminence and stature.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.26,0:58:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,M是一位探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}M here is an agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.83,0:58:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,一位没有小兵的探员 你懂我意思吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}An agent without a pawn, if you see my meaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.01,0:58:25.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还没想过这点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never thought of this,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.85,0:58:28.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是也许致敬亡者最好的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}but maybe the best way to honor the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.38,0:58:30.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就是继续活下去 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- is to go on living. - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.83,0:58:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向你献上永恒的忠诚 M探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pledge loyalty eternal to you, Agent M.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.90,0:58:36.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不 我对臣子不感兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. I'm not interested in a subject.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.24,0:58:38.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,太迟了 说完了 我已经献上了忠诚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too late. It's done. I already pledged the loyalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.65,0:58:40.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,真希望你能早点说不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wish you'd said "no, no, no" before.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.12,0:58:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.53,0:58:44.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你在我之前逝去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you should die before I,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.53,0:58:46.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓将以最痛苦的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise to end my own life…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.29,0:58:48.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,「结束自己的生命」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"In the most painful way possible."
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.91,0:58:51.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我不喜欢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Ha. I don't like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.25,0:58:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.00,0:58:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.67,0:58:57.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 我们会相处得很愉快的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. We'll have a fun time.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.40,0:58:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 - 太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fine. - Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.39,0:59:04.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,H 有件事我应该告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}H, there's something that I've been meaning to tell you about.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.51,0:59:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我一直想告诉你 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I've been wanting to tell you… - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.89,0:59:08.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这个 哪去了 - 你是说这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …about it. Where is it? - You mean this?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.94,0:59:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你从我这偷走的 - 从你那偷走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You stole it from me? - Stole it from you?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.56,0:59:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是取回你从犯罪现场偷走的证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}I recovered evidence you stole from a crime scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.98,0:59:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,万格斯让我把它藏好 我不知道该信任谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vungus told me to hide it and I couldn't trust anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.07,0:59:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说 你听万格斯的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're telling me you listened to Vungus,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.40,0:59:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你信任万格斯 却不信任你的搭档\N{\fnArial\fs30}you trusted Vungus instead of your partner,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.24,0:59:21.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,一位资深探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}a senior agent?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.70,0:59:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,总的来说 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a word, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.20,0:59:25.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,H 说到探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}H, speaking of agents…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.33,0:59:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.82,0:59:31.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们为什么会在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would they be here?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.00,0:59:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么这里要举办一场我们不知道的颁奖典礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's either an award show we're not aware of.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.51,0:59:35.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么是我们有大麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}or we're in deep shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.27,0:59:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 我要你封锁每一条街道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. I need you to close every street,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.77,0:59:39.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,每一道拱门和下水道\N{\fnArial\fs30}every archway and every sewer now.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.77,0:59:41.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉近那边那个摄像头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in closer on that body cam there, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.39,0:59:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再近一点 - 有谁可以跟我解释一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A bit more. - Could someone please explain to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.25,0:59:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这到底是怎么回事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}what the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.98,0:59:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 这个话题比较敏感\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, slightly sensitive subject.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.74,0:59:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以最好不要声张\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought it best to keep it quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.86,0:59:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再拉近一点 - C 借一步说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A bit further in, please. - C, a word.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.20,0:59:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 不许放任何人逃离麦地那市 懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absolutely. No one leaves the Medina, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.49,0:59:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太荒谬了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This… This is nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.75,0:59:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,抛开你的个人情感而言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Despite your personal feelings,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.16,1:00:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,H是有史以来最棒的黑衣人探员之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}H is one of the best agents ever to wear this suit.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.91,1:00:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他曾经是有史以来最棒的黑衣人探员之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he was one of the best agents to wear this suit.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.25,1:00:07.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是从蜂兽那件事之后他就不一样了 你看\N{\fnArial\fs30}He hasn't been the same since the Hive. Look. Look.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.77,1:00:12.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的线人称\N{\fnArial\fs30}My sources say that Vungus stole it.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.12,1:00:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,万格斯将其从加贝边作战部高级研究所偷走\N{\fnArial\fs30}from the Jababian War Department Advanced Research Division.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.78,1:00:16.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,并带到了这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}and brought it here.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.41,1:00:19.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你一直瞒着我 瞒了多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you kept this from me? For how long?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.52,1:00:21.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 解释一下你的行为 - 解释我的行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Explain yourself. - Oh, explain myself?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.06,1:00:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 不管这东西是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, whatever that thing is,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.56,1:00:26.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前在你办公室时 它在M和H身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}M and H had it in your office,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.90,1:00:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你放走了他们 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you let them go, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.98,1:00:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,无意冒犯 但是你放走了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}With all due respect, you let them go.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.53,1:00:40.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 继续吧 - 是 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Carry on. - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.66,1:00:42.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- C 还有 - 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And, C. - Sir?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.04,1:00:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,直接带他们来见我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring them straight to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.75,1:00:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论那东西是什么 万格斯不惜一死保护它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever that thing is, Vungus died to protect it.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.09,1:00:53.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把它给了我 为了不让它落到他们手上\N{\fnArial\fs30}He gave it to me so it wouldn't go to them.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.69,1:01:00.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 长官 - H 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, sir. - H, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.02,1:01:02.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是我下的命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't my operation.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.27,1:01:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽快离开那里 到安全的地方再向我汇报\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of there. Get safe. Then report.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.81,1:01:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- M可能是对的 - 你 每十分钟我要听到一次汇报\N{\fnArial\fs30}- M may be right. - You, I want sitreps every 10 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.11,1:01:10.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑衣人里可能有内奸\N{\fnArial\fs30}There could be a mole in the Men in Black.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.16,1:01:22.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 拿着这个 我去引开他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Take this. I'll draw them away.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.62,1:01:24.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,二十分钟后 中央广场见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll meet you at the main square in 20.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.21,1:01:25.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.92,1:01:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 这也太巧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys, what are the odds?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.81,1:02:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳斯尔 我要借用你的摩托车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nasr! I need to borrow your bike.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.73,1:02:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 只要是借不是偷\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as it is to borrow, not steal.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.15,1:02:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Of course. Quick.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.52,1:02:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快 - 巴萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. - Bassam!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.49,1:02:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 油门 刹车 - 水\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, accelerator, brake. - Water.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.58,1:02:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 外面非常热 - 你想得真周到\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Very hot out there. - That's very thoughtful of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.99,1:02:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个应该很简单吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is all pretty straightforward, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.41,1:02:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 确实非常简单 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Very straightforward, indeed. Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.67,1:02:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,就跟骑普通的摩托车一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like riding a bike.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.50,1:02:51.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 那就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, cool.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.47,1:03:00.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.46,1:03:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这跟骑普通的摩托车一点都不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this is nothing like riding a bike at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.14,1:03:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quick, jump on!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.57,1:04:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓紧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on tight.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.94,1:04:09.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.90,1:04:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚持住 兵兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on, Pawny!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.44,1:04:16.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚持住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.41,1:04:18.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.83,1:04:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.69,1:04:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不敢相信这招居然能行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe that actually worked.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.77,1:04:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- H - 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, H? - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.15,1:04:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 戴眼镜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Glasses.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.38,1:04:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家好 你们能看着我这里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, everyone. If you could all look right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.39,1:04:36.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,开你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just drive.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.95,1:04:51.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,快闪开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move! Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.51,1:05:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.84,1:05:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得呢 按红色按钮怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think? Press the red button?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.27,1:05:14.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得这是超光速引擎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's hyperdrive.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.30,1:05:16.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我觉得超光速引擎是蓝色按钮\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I think hyperdrive is blue.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.34,1:05:18.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,有的时候人得相信自己的直觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes you have to trust your gut.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.67,1:05:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的直觉 不是你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My gut, not yours!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.64,1:05:24.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托谁随便按个按钮吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody press something!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.08,1:05:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他们甩掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lost the tail.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.70,1:05:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说什么来着 超光速引擎\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd I tell you, huh? Hyperdrive.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.27,1:05:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是是 好的 - 相信自己的直觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, yeah. Okay. - Trust your gut. Trust your gut.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.93,1:05:58.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 我讨厌沙子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God, I hate sand.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.25,1:06:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,红色按钮太酷炫了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The red button was awesome!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.31,1:06:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们再按一次红色按钮吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's press the red button again.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.08,1:06:16.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's it doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.87,1:06:19.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,移动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moving.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.83,1:06:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? What is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.64,1:06:35.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到核心了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}See the core?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.07,1:06:36.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到它持续释放的对流能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}How it keeps emitting convective energy.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.69,1:06:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是如何穿梭在光球层的了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}across the interior of the photosphere?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.94,1:06:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我都看见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah. No, I see all of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.49,1:06:42.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了光球层\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see the… the photosphere bit.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.75,1:06:43.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 嘘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, yeah. Shh.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.66,1:06:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些是热核爆炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those are thermonuclear explosions.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.84,1:06:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 什么意思 这是炸弹之类的东西吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, what? What does that mean? Like a bomb or something?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.24,1:06:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为我们看到的是一颗被超压缩的恒星\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think what we're looking at is a super compressed star.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.95,1:06:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据这个色温来看\N{\fnArial\fs30}And by the color temperature,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.11,1:06:58.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得这是一颗蓝巨星\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd say it's a blue giant.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.95,1:07:02.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,按一下这个按钮 我们瞧瞧它的威力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's press the button. Let's see what this does.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.01,1:07:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你提议我们拿一颗被武器化的恒星取乐吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you suggesting we try a weaponized star for fun?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.03,1:07:08.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了科学和取乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, for science and fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.22,1:07:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这两项倒是不冲突 好吧 - 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The two aren't mutually exclusive. Okay. - I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.92,1:07:13.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确 没有比这里更合适的地方了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, there is no better place.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.09,1:07:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都把这里称之为空白之地了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't call it the Empty Quarter for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.00,1:07:17.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 所以我才这么提议的 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! That's why I made the suggestion. Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.82,1:07:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就用千分之一的威力吧 你觉得呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}At just.001? What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.34,1:07:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 从最低档位开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Just start off slow.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.59,1:07:24.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 按下去吧 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Press the button. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.74,1:07:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不往上推几档\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe ratchet it up a few notches,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.86,1:07:35.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,调高一点…\N{\fnArial\fs30}a little higher…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.50,1:07:44.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这还是最低档位\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was the low setting?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.63,1:07:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得会有人注意到之前没有这个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do we think anyone's gonna notice that wasn't there before?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.59,1:08:04.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 他们逃走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, they got away.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.77,1:08:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想 更恰当的说法是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe the appropriate phrase is…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.27,1:08:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把他们跟丢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you lost them.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.03,1:08:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 我要说的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I put it to you, sir…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.95,1:08:17.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们有帮手 - 也许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- that they had help. - Probably.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.88,1:08:19.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我了解H\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I know H.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.43,1:08:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管他在做什么 都是有理由的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever he's doing, there's a reason.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.32,1:08:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你一直袒护他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you keep protecting him?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.76,1:08:26.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底怎样你才能明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it going to take?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.07,1:08:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在保护这个机构\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am protecting this institution.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.07,1:08:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,从谁手中保护 我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}From what? From me?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.31,1:08:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是在质疑我的忠诚吗 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you questioning my loyalty, sir?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.89,1:08:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,最起码是质疑你的判断力\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the very least, your judgment.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.71,1:08:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有什么事吗 探员C\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there anything else, Agent C?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.45,1:08:46.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有 长官 - 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, sir. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.98,1:08:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么请你出去好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then would you kindly leave?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.28,1:09:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,万格斯知道这玩意威力有多大 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vungus knew how powerful that thing was, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.82,1:09:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道这可以毁灭整个世界 而他交给了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knew it could destroy worlds, and he gave it to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.52,1:09:16.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能理解 你和他才刚认识\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand. Someone he only just met.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.97,1:09:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他为什么要这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would he do that?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.11,1:09:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.58,1:09:24.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他信任我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he trusted me.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.26,1:09:27.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不怀疑你大致的可靠性\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna doubt your general trustworthiness,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.53,1:09:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我可在万格斯母亲的葬礼上唱过歌\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, I mean, I sang at Vungus' mother's funeral.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.07,1:09:33.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,补充一点 唱得还挺好听\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quite beautifully, I might add.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.66,1:09:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们了解彼此的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}We knew everything about one another.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.32,1:09:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很确定他信任我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, hey, I'm pretty sure he trusted me.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.56,1:09:42.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 H 如果你一定要知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, H, if you must know…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.64,1:09:44.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说你变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}he said that you'd changed.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.48,1:09:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经厌烦听到「你变了」这种陈词滥调了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm getting sick of hearing this "you've changed" crap.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.16,1:09:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是几年前的我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the same person I was years ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.58,1:09:52.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是想说你一直都是这样的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You meant to tell me you've always been this way?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.41,1:09:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What way?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.26,1:09:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点笨拙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vaguely inept.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.51,1:09:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,傲慢 鲁莽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arrogant. Reckless.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.52,1:10:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我还有遗漏吗 - 好吧 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did I miss anything? - Okay, yeah. Hey, look.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.99,1:10:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,傲慢 鲁莽 真会说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arrogant and reckless. Well, That's just nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.49,1:10:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我有的时候是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I am a few of those things occasionally,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.36,1:10:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我的工作是拯救地球 这就是我要做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but guess what, my job is saving the planet, and that's what I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.30,1:10:10.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也做得很好 只要我在拯救世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do a good job at it. While that's still happening,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.52,1:10:12.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,规定就是 没有规定\N{\fnArial\fs30}the rules are: there are no rules.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.81,1:10:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那也算个规定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's a rule.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.43,1:10:18.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的 好了 谁都不许动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it. All right, nobody move!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.93,1:10:21.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 放下 毛球 - 谁都不许动\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Drop it, hairball! - Nobody move.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.42,1:10:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 巴萨姆 你怎么来了 - 喝饱了吧 H\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bassam. How'd you get here? - Feeling hydrated, H?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.18,1:10:26.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还从来没洗过澡呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never had a bath before.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.96,1:10:30.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 光是身上的泥就洗掉了两斤 - 天呐 我们还喝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lost 2 pounds in dirt alone. - God, we drank from that.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.22,1:10:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐 我就觉得有一股活胡子的味道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God, I thought it tasted like a living beard.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.65,1:10:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, um…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.34,1:10:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴萨姆 听我说好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bassam, listen, all right, mate?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.98,1:10:37.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,讲讲理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's be sensible.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.99,1:10:40.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道自己拿的是什么东西 所以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think you know what you're dealing with, so…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.31,1:10:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我当然知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, I definitely do.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.98,1:10:44.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以她才会出个高价\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is why she's gonna pay so much for it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.85,1:10:46.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 等等 - 不不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, wait. Wait, wait! - No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.90,1:10:49.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,生活愉快 笨蛋们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have a nice life, bozos!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.55,1:10:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得漂亮 H\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great job, H.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.71,1:11:01.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,兵兵 能麻烦你请她把扭力扳手递给我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pawny, can you ask her to pass me the torque wrench?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.46,1:11:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,她有名字也有头衔 你很清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}She has a name and a title, and you know that.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.96,1:11:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,夫人 那个混蛋跟你要扭力扳手\N{\fnArial\fs30}My lady, the jackass wants a torque wrench.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.24,1:11:11.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,兵兵 麻烦你告诉他他越快恢复\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pawny, will you tell him the sooner he restores power.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.81,1:11:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,驱动控制台的动力 我就能越快搞清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}to my drive console, the sooner I can figure out.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.99,1:11:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么修好程序 - 夫人说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- how to program it? - My lady says.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.75,1:11:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个毫无用处 因为自己的轻信\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're a cloth-brained ass-clown whose gullible idiocy.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.66,1:11:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,让整个星球陷入危机的混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}has threatened the very existence of the planet.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.15,1:11:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,她没这么说好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what, she didn't say that. All right?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.58,1:11:25.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个棋盘上最没用的小东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}You worst piece on the chess board.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.14,1:11:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她说了 - 一个字也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She said that. - Didn't say any of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.14,1:11:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我是这么想的 一个字都不差\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but I was thinking it. Actually, every single word.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.08,1:11:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得很好 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You make a really good point. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.74,1:11:40.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻烦你告诉你家夫人动力恢复了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you'll tell your lady she now has power.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.73,1:11:44.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,夫人 那个混蛋说动力恢复了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The jackass says, my lady, that you have power.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.69,1:11:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 能替我谢谢他吗 - 不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can you thank him? - Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.39,1:11:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷冷地客套一下就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}But in a cold, kind of polite way.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.30,1:11:51.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞪他一眼也是可以的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can even put a glare on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.19,1:11:53.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看着办吧 我相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just play around with it. I trust you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.36,1:11:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,夫人说谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}My lady says thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.37,1:12:00.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道他要带武器去哪 也知道怎么弄回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know where the weapon's going and how to get it back.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.56,1:12:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 夫人 - 这次我来 我听着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My lady? - I got this one. I'm listening.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.53,1:12:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴萨姆只认识一个真正的买家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bassam has only one real buyer:
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.76,1:12:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞莎·斯塔夫罗斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Riza Stavros.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.75,1:12:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞莎 跟你交往过的那个瑞莎吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Riza? The Riza that you went out with?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.03,1:12:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个星际外星武器商瑞莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}The intergalactic, alien arms-dealer Riza?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.81,1:12:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我稍微倒带一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna hop back in for a second.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.38,1:12:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟瑞莎·斯塔夫罗斯交往过 那个死亡商人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You dated Riza Stavros, the Merchant of Death?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.70,1:12:20.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,谋杀之母\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Mother of Murder?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.07,1:12:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她是挺辣的 - 我们初遇时\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's pretty hot. - Okay, I didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.80,1:12:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我并不知道她是军火商\N{\fnArial\fs30}she was an arms dealer when we met.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.98,1:12:28.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我当时因为她的女性心机和\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I was distracted by her feminine wiles.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.44,1:12:30.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,醉人的美分了神\N{\fnArial\fs30}and her intoxicating beauty.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.02,1:12:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说了 我们对身份不感兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}And besides, we weren't interested in labels.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.10,1:12:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是被对方的心吸引了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were interested in our hearts.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.43,1:12:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是心里有爱也是罪 那就处我死刑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}If having a big, old heart is a crime, then shoot me.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.06,1:12:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,先别动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.36,1:12:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要动手的时候你会让我来的 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll let me know, though, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.75,1:12:44.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But really?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.35,1:12:47.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还「心里有爱」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your "big, old heart"?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.81,1:12:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了 - 就是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - It's just…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.93,1:12:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好笑 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it… It's funny, is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.49,1:12:58.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,「心里有爱」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"My big, old heart."
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.43,1:13:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真蠢 - 谁会这么说话啊 大笨蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So stupid. - Who talks like that? Ha-ha-ha. Big, old doofus.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.68,1:13:06.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从没谈过恋爱 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've never been in love, have you?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.81,1:13:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有嘲笑你的意思 我是真的好奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not making fun. I'm genuinely asking.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.02,1:13:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从来没有为激情放弃过逻辑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've never once abandoned logic for passion?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.98,1:13:18.26,Title,0,0,0,0,,搞什么啊 《恋恋笔记本》续集吗 我是没看过\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this? The sequel to The Notebook? I never saw it,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.26,1:13:21.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我觉得那电影扯的就是这种故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I assume it's a lot of this type of nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.38,1:13:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我没谈过 激情不稳定\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I haven't. Passion is unstable,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.02,1:13:26.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 逻辑才是永恒 - 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and logic is constant. - Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.61,1:13:28.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 生理吸引力不过是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Physical attraction is nothing more.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.93,1:13:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,大脑中的化学反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}than chemical reactions in your brain.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.01,1:13:33.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可信赖 它们不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't trust them. They're not real.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.24,1:13:37.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道整个宇宙不都是化学反应组成的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't the whole universe a chemical reaction?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.09,1:13:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得宇宙还是挺值得信赖的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty sure you can trust that.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.66,1:13:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉挺真实的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feels pretty real.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.05,1:13:46.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这话其实还蛮深刻的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's actually kind of deep.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.23,1:13:51.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该可以了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that should do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.07,1:13:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,启动吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Power her up.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.58,1:13:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.12,1:14:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,兵兵 换个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pawny. Not there.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.48,1:14:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就能跳这么远\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's as far as I could jump.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.87,1:14:07.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实还能跳高点 但是我觉得高点更尴尬\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could jump higher, but it would've been more awkward.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.91,1:14:09.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.33,1:14:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.19,1:14:18.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And look at that.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.99,1:14:20.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well done.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.37,1:14:24.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我了解瑞莎 虽说她是死亡商人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know Riza. She may be the Merchant of Death,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.25,1:14:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她却有一个弱点\N{\fnArial\fs30}but she does have one weakness.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.66,1:14:28.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好当英雄了吗 小家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready to be a hero, little guy?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.21,1:14:29.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我当什么都行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty open to anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.71,1:14:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 因为我们要去那不勒斯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good, because we're going to Naples.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.62,1:14:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,去瑞莎的来者必死武装要塞吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}To Riza's Fortified Fortress of For Sure Death?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.12,1:14:45.65,Note,0,0,0,0,,（瑞莎的来者必死武装要塞）
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.50,1:15:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,别开枪 别开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't shoot. Don't shoot.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.37,1:15:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.70,1:15:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们改天再继续好吗 我又来了一个客人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we do this another day? I have another visitor.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.28,1:15:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没问题 - 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Absolutely. - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.74,1:15:16.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.06,1:15:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Au revoir.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.95,1:15:18.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再见 - 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bye. - Bye.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.94,1:15:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luca.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.00,1:15:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 想我了吗 - 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you miss me? - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.63,1:15:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,H\N{\fnArial\fs30}H.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.27,1:15:41.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你为什么来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know why you're here.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.06,1:15:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么穿了条粉裤子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you wearing pink trousers?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.90,1:16:03.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how have you been?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.08,1:16:07.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好久不见了 分手最不好的就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been a while, huh? That's the tough thing about breakups,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.24,1:16:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,会同时失去朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}is the friendships you lose.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.72,1:16:13.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们以前多要好 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had some good times, though, didn't we?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.76,1:16:17.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想也许是我和瑞莎要好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Riza and I had good times, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.25,1:16:19.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只是在背后默默跟着\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just lurked in the background a bit.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.29,1:16:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是不是很美\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wonderful, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.54,1:16:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just love.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.06,1:16:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,又蠢又美的小东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}dumb, beautiful creatures.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.82,1:16:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,真令人怀念 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this is familiar, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.91,1:16:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.60,1:16:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑衣人终于把你开除了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}MIB finally showed you the door, eh?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.31,1:16:53.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实是我自己主动退出的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Showed myself out, actually.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.98,1:16:56.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些人生来注定自由自在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some horses are born to roam free.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.45,1:16:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有人注定中枪 你来干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And others just get shot. What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.90,1:17:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想来看看你 给你带了礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to see you. And I brought you something.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.36,1:17:07.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道喜欢特殊的宠物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how you like special pets,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.21,1:17:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我带了求和礼物给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I brought you a peace offering.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.80,1:17:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,喵 喵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meow, meow.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.44,1:17:13.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,汪 汪 诸如此类\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bark, woof, et cetera, et cetera.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.28,1:17:14.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like it.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.32,1:17:19.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他真是丑到可爱了 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is cute in an ugly sort of way, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.17,1:17:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个物种的最后一只\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last of his kind.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.32,1:17:23.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总是这么了解我的心 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You always did know the way to my heart, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.93,1:17:27.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总是能让我心跳加速\N{\fnArial\fs30}You always knew how to make mine beat that little bit faster.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.65,1:17:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么记忆消除器也没法让我忘了这段对话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a neuralyzer in the world could make me forget that.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.32,1:17:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实我本来还挺期待\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was actually looking forward.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.90,1:17:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,看我的枪把你打成马蜂窝 接着就看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}to seeing my guns tear you to pieces, then I saw.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.67,1:17:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那张完美的小脸 然后我就…\N{\fnArial\fs30}that perfect little face of yours, and…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.94,1:17:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须要知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to know.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.04,1:17:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Know what?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.43,1:17:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要知道真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to know the truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.39,1:17:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,是真感情吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was this ever real?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.03,1:17:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们之间\N{\fnArial\fs30}This?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.16,1:17:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我 是真感情吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, me? Was it?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.54,1:17:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下有好戏看了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This'll be good.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.93,1:17:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was it?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.36,1:18:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从一开始就知道你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew who you were from the start.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.91,1:18:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的工作就是赢得你的信任\N{\fnArial\fs30}My job was to gain your trust.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.52,1:18:06.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,等到时机成熟\N{\fnArial\fs30}and take you down.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.69,1:18:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,一举拿下你 这就是真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}when the opportunity came. That's the truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.48,1:18:11.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是把耳机关掉吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotta turn my earpiece off for this.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.99,1:18:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐 闭嘴行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, shut up.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.40,1:18:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 不是 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - No, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.11,1:18:18.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是在和我的内心对话\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what I say to my heart…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.32,1:18:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像脑海里还有另一个声音和我争吵\N{\fnArial\fs30}when it's like a voice inside my head.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.51,1:18:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.14,1:18:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种事我无法假装\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't fake that.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.94,1:18:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.18,1:18:28.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.29,1:18:31.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我是说谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, but thank you for…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.90,1:18:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我能够释怀\N{\fnArial\fs30}for giving me closure.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.83,1:18:36.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁都有需要释怀的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all need some… Some closure from time to time.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.26,1:18:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把他带出去 - 什么 等等 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get him out of here. - What? Wait, no. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.76,1:18:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我也需要释怀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. I need some closure too.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.71,1:18:43.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我的感受怎么办 - H 给你个小建议\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What about my feelings? - H, here's a tip for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.38,1:18:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次你要送求和礼物的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next time you bring a peace offering,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.42,1:18:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要选我拿到史上\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't make it the same day I come into possession.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.38,1:18:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,最强武器的那天\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the most powerful weapon ever created.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.89,1:18:51.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这两件事没有任何关联\N{\fnArial\fs30}This has nothing to do with that.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.13,1:18:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都不知道你拿到了什么武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know you had a weapon.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.41,1:18:54.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全没有关联 只是巧合\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a separate thing. A coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.71,1:18:56.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全是巧合 我真的不知道她拿到武器了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Total coincidence. Didn't know she had a weapon.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.69,1:18:58.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道她拿到武器了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you know that she has a weapon?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.08,1:19:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,带他去船上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take him to the boat.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.43,1:19:02.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 行 行\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Okay, okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.67,1:19:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们 要我说还挺顺利的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fellas, I think that went pretty well.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.61,1:19:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我们以后要常见面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like we'll be seeing a lot more of each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.40,1:19:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.23,1:19:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.06,1:19:45.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞巴斯蒂安 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sebastian, darling.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.86,1:19:47.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想不想足不出户\N{\fnArial\fs30}How would you like to be able to destroy.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.62,1:19:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能摧毁整个太阳系\N{\fnArial\fs30}entire solar systems without leaving your home?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.25,1:19:52.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 兵兵 - 嗯 我看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Pawny? - Yeah, I see it.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.83,1:19:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧瞧这个 搞定了 M\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you look at that. Good to go, M.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.18,1:20:03.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 兵兵 就看你的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Pawny, it's all on you now.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.39,1:20:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种压力对我不是很有帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, that kind of pressure is not constructive.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.12,1:20:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情很简单 亲爱的 你是要还是不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's very simple, darling. Do you want it or not?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.66,1:20:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我只有一个 塞巴斯蒂安\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I only have one, Sebastian,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.83,1:20:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且很快就会卖出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I won't have that for long.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.30,1:20:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我只给你五秒钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm gonna give you five seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.18,1:20:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfectly done.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.31,1:20:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回头再打给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to call you back.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.92,1:20:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟了 糟了 完蛋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crap. Oh, crap. Oh, crap.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.04,1:20:27.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,看你那小短腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at your little legs.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.62,1:20:29.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,居然跑这么快\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are so fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.34,1:20:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你跑步的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, look at you run.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.42,1:20:35.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跑得真快\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're so fast!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.94,1:20:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我来了 我来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, I'm coming. I'm coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.70,1:20:46.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不许再逃跑了 你好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you don't run away again. Oh, hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.86,1:20:51.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为\N{\fnArial\fs30}And here I thought…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.77,1:20:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,H是单干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}H worked alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.68,1:20:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真傻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Silly me.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.08,1:20:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真惨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poor you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.46,1:21:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实花了一段时间让他接受我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been a steep learning curve, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.55,1:21:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个吗 这是一把短管卡其格歼灭者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that? That's a snub-nosed Karzig annihilator.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.39,1:21:11.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道人类被它击中会有什么后果吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know what that does to a human body?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.97,1:21:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,它会让你由内而外地沸腾\N{\fnArial\fs30}It boils you from the inside out.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.17,1:21:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cute.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.28,1:21:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道兵兵会对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know what a Pawny does.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.01,1:21:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,暴虐成性的外星人武器贩子做什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}to sadistic alien arms-dealers?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.00,1:21:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 亲爱的 告诉我什么是兵兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, honey. Tell me what a Pawny is.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.39,1:21:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是兵兵 你这个神经病\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a Pawny, you psycho!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.37,1:22:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来形势逆转了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like the tables have turned.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.94,1:22:20.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,接得真准\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was an incredible catch.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.30,1:22:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That felt good.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.98,1:23:06.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,M\N{\fnArial\fs30}M.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.62,1:23:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,M 别担心 别担心 这都是计划好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}M, don't worry. Don't worry. It's all part of the plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.56,1:23:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,H 你的妄想症一点都没见好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, H, you always have been rather delusional.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.06,1:23:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,求和礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peace offering.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.68,1:23:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill them.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.60,1:23:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,先杀他 多折磨一会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Start with him and make it hurt.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.48,1:23:29.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你没必要这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! You don't have to do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.12,1:23:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我放下 你这个塔伦特恶棍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put me down, you Tarantian thug.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.90,1:23:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你说他是塔伦特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Did you say "Tarantian"?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.13,1:23:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 没错 夫人 他说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes. - Yes, my lady, he did.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.25,1:23:39.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要是跟杀人有关的事 他们就特别执着\N{\fnArial\fs30}They tend to be very single-minded when it comes to killing.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.99,1:23:41.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的大脑只有开心果那么大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brains the size of a pistachio nut.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.77,1:23:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,小声点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, shh.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.29,1:23:43.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这是帮倒忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not helping.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.08,1:23:49.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你见到的生物是一只来自仙女座II的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The creature you saw was an unlicensed Tarantian.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.83,1:23:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,无证塔伦特\N{\fnArial\fs30}from Andromeda II.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.48,1:23:53.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔伦特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tarantian?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.84,1:23:58.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识一个塔伦特\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know a Tarantian.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.53,1:24:00.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前遇到过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I met one once.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.82,1:24:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我帮了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I helped him.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.28,1:24:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kabla nakshulin\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kabla nakshulin.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.49,1:24:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.00,1:24:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kabla nakshulin\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kabla nakshulin?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.66,1:24:13.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她说的那句 - 你怎么会知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What she said. - How do you know that?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.46,1:24:14.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他是这么跟我说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because he said it to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.93,1:24:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Molly?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.39,1:24:24.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.51,1:24:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫莉 你们在玩我吗 不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Molly? Are you shitting me? Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.64,1:24:31.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是谁有妄想症\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's delusional now?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.81,1:24:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's you?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.23,1:24:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你长大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've grown.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.98,1:24:40.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, me too.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.20,1:24:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,把盒子给她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give her the box.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.20,1:24:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢卡 你不能这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luca, you can't do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.79,1:24:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对你不好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haven't I been good to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.83,1:24:51.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让你随心所欲地杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've let you kill anyone you wanted.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.16,1:24:53.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.50,1:24:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.25,1:24:59.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我盒子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The box.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.43,1:25:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.93,1:25:07.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 你改变了我的人生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You changed my life, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.81,1:25:09.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,问一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quickly.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.56,1:25:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kabla nakshulin是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kabla nakshulin, what does it mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.10,1:25:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,意思是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It means:
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.31,1:25:17.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,「有一天 我会用你能想象的最恐怖的方法」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"One day, I'll kill whoever you choose.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.15,1:25:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,「杀掉任何你想杀的人」\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the most gruesome way imaginable."
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.36,1:25:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我们先把她关在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or maybe we just keep her here for a moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.99,1:25:25.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我们商量好行动计划再说\N{\fnArial\fs30}until he and I can discuss a plan of action.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.12,1:25:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,H 你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}H? H, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.58,1:25:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.83,1:25:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚真刺激\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was… That was a rush.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.71,1:25:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 还特别痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and incredibly painful.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.71,1:25:38.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 很显然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Pretty sure the plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.46,1:25:41.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这个计划漏洞百出 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- went wrong in every conceivable way. - Yeah, well…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.88,1:25:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫莫莉 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh, it's Molly, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.55,1:25:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不应该让你知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not supposed to know that.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.64,1:25:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 太晚了 我已经知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, too late. I know it now.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.22,1:25:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,公平起见 只能告诉你我的名字了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess it's only fair that you know mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.64,1:25:54.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不想知道 - 我要告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't wanna know yours. - I'm gonna tell you.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.02,1:25:55.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 - 准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - You ready?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.69,1:25:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍雷肖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Horatio.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.98,1:25:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不叫这个 - 确实不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It is not. - It's not.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.44,1:26:01.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫亨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Henry.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.78,1:26:03.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 你看上去就像叫亨利的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you look like a Henry.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.94,1:26:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很好 我就叫这个 - 我叫史蒂夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good. It's all I've got. - I'm Steve.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.66,1:26:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,史蒂夫 我记得你说小兵没有名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steve? I thought you said Pawns didn't have names.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.49,1:26:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实没有 我只是觉得被忽略了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't. I was just feeling left out.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.20,1:26:14.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,史蒂夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steve.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.47,1:26:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.84,1:26:27.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可不妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is not cool.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.93,1:26:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢地面变成这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like what the earth is doing now.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.52,1:26:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.27,1:26:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kabla nakshulin\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kabla nakshulin!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.69,1:26:47.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,试试无妨\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was worth a try.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.28,1:26:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了蜂兽 我们必须拿到那件武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must have the weapon, for the Hive.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.07,1:26:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 不知你们有没有听说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I don't know if you've heard,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.41,1:26:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们是黑衣人\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we are the Men in Black.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.75,1:26:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑衣男女\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Men and Women in Black.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.67,1:27:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,说得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice save.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.46,1:27:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们觉得我们会直接把它交出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you think we'll just hand this over,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.25,1:27:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就大错特错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you've got another think coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.34,1:27:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不知道自己在跟什么人打交道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know who you're dealing with.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.80,1:27:08.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们保护地球\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, we protect the Earth.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.26,1:27:10.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说保护地球上的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that means everyone and everything on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.26,1:27:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们想来抢吗 你们想开打吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you wanna do this? You wanna get down?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.05,1:27:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 尽管上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.64,1:27:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们敢动一下 我就消灭这整个岛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move, and I'll obliterate this entire island.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.56,1:27:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有岛上的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}and everything on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.82,1:27:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 也包括我们自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Including us.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.03,1:27:26.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不觉得在我长篇大论之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't think we should've spoken about this before.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.44,1:27:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该先讨论一下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just gave a whole speech?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.57,1:27:28.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 你说得很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I liked the speech.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.65,1:27:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是觉得这样会更有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just thought this would be more effective.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.03,1:27:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们听到了 别逼我用它\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard me. Don't make me use it.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.41,1:27:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会不惜一切保护我们的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll do anything to protect our world.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.46,1:27:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也会\N{\fnArial\fs30}So will we.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.52,1:28:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个宇宙里没有什么是杀不了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing in this universe is unkillable.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.35,1:28:03.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要电压够强\N{\fnArial\fs30}With the proper voltage.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.77,1:28:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you both all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.48,1:28:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 长官 好得不得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir. Never better.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.90,1:28:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 长官 你是怎么找到我们的 - 凭经验\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sir, how did you find us? - Experience.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.99,1:28:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,又是瑞莎吗 H\N{\fnArial\fs30}Riza again, H?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.62,1:28:15.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么时候才会吸取教训\N{\fnArial\fs30}When are you going to learn?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.25,1:28:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道你靠得住\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew I could count on you.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.71,1:28:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最后总能挺过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}That, in the end, you'd pull through.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.62,1:28:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.17,1:28:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是 M\N{\fnArial\fs30}You too, M.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.79,1:28:27.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,探员O对你有预感 她没看错人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent O had a feeling about you, and she was right.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.09,1:28:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,宇宙总有办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}The universe has a way of leading you.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.64,1:28:36.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,在恰当的时机\N{\fnArial\fs30}to where you're supposed to be…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.51,1:28:38.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,将你引向应该去的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the moment you're supposed to be there.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.98,1:28:43.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们回家吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go home.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.49,1:28:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们好好保管它 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's keep this safe, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.12,1:29:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,桑德 通知加贝边使馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saunder, inform the Jababian embassy,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.66,1:29:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,武器在我们手里\N{\fnArial\fs30}we have the weapon.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.59,1:29:07.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,M 对于见习探员来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quite the first assignment.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.59,1:29:09.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个首次任务很惊险\N{\fnArial\fs30}for a probationary agent, M.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.13,1:29:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,马拉喀什 空白之地 那不勒斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marrakesh, the Empty Quarter, Naples.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.30,1:29:17.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,想象一下你正式加入我们后会有怎样的成就\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imagine what you will accomplish when you're one of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.56,1:29:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 长官 - 好好享受此刻 M\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, sir. - Enjoy this moment, M.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.73,1:29:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会持续太久\N{\fnArial\fs30}They never last.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.48,1:29:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你是怎么做到的 但是你总能成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how you do it, but you just keep doing it.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.24,1:29:32.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 我做什么了 C\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? What's that, C?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.82,1:29:34.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,拯救世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, saving the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.36,1:29:36.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,让它免于毁灭 而且是两次\N{\fnArial\fs30}from total destruction twice…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.87,1:29:37.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,短短几年之间\N{\fnArial\fs30}in as many years.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:37.83,1:29:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.58,1:29:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这也太巧了 - 这也太巧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- what are the odds? - What are the odds?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.50,1:29:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑衣人\N{\fnArial\fs30}MIB!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.71,1:29:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.88,1:29:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 失陪一下 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Excuse me. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.47,1:30:01.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,觉得怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's it going?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.64,1:30:03.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你懂的 - 派对很酷 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know. - Cool party, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.18,1:30:05.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 派对很棒 - 有事不对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, great party. - Something is wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.48,1:30:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我也这么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. That's what I was thinking.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.77,1:30:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉幻影双煞我们会不惜一切拯救我们的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said to the Dyads we'd do anything to save our world.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.65,1:30:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说他们也会\N{\fnArial\fs30}They said that they would too.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.23,1:30:14.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说 为了蜂兽 他们必须拿到那件武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then they told us they needed the weapon for the Hive.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.78,1:30:16.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们误解了他们的意思呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if we misunderstood what that meant?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.82,1:30:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他们需要用那件武器来对付蜂兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe they needed the weapon to use against the Hive.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.16,1:30:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,拯救他们的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}to save their world.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.41,1:30:23.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可能意味着他们根本不是蜂兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which could mean they were never the Hive at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:25.41,1:30:27.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他们的DNA 突变\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the DNA, the mutations.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.17,1:30:28.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,老大T给我们看了样本\N{\fnArial\fs30}High T showed us that sample.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.58,1:30:30.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我们看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.09,1:30:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是探员H 请调出幻影双煞的法医报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent H, bring up the Dyad forensic report.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.69,1:30:35.47,Note,0,0,0,0,,（正在搜索）
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.84,1:30:37.51,Note,0,0,0,0,,（档案已删除）
Dialogue: 0,1:30:37.97,1:30:40.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁有让案件档案消失的权限\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who has the authority to make a case file disappear?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.64,1:30:41.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.23,1:30:53.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有那不勒斯的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what about Naples?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.78,1:30:55.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么知道我们在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did he know we were there?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.49,1:30:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在做分内事\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was doing his job.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.70,1:30:58.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,分内事包括跟踪我们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does his job include tracking us?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.82,1:31:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是他送我的礼物 里面有芯片\N{\fnArial\fs30}He gave this to me as a gift. It has a chip inside it.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.79,1:31:06.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要看没收的加贝边武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to see the confiscated Jababian weapon.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.21,1:31:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not possible.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.33,1:31:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 我是负责这个案子的高级探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not possible? I'm the senior agent on the case.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.25,1:31:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说行就行 武器在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's make it possible. Where's the weapon?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.47,1:31:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得他一直在追寻这件武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think he's been chasing it the entire time.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.30,1:31:24.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,老大T就是内奸 一定是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}High T is the mole. He's gotta be.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.31,1:31:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁派来的内奸 他要把武器拿去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}A mole for who? Where would he take it?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.02,1:31:27.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴黎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paris.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.64,1:31:29.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得是巴黎\N{\fnArial\fs30}My guess would be Paris.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.14,1:31:31.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自始至终都觉得不对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew all along that something was off.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.81,1:31:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为他是在替你打掩护\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought he was covering for you,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.27,1:31:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是有问题的是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it turns out, it was him.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.61,1:31:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是在掩盖自己的踪迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was hiding his own tracks.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.94,1:31:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定是有原因的 M 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotta be an explanation. M, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.90,1:31:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我跟你们一起去 - 不行 C\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm coming with you. - No, C.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.41,1:31:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,别闹了 重点不在于你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, now. This isn't about you.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.12,1:31:44.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. I agree.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.58,1:31:47.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 如果事实证明你说的是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, if it turns out what you're saying is true.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.29,1:31:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后消息传出去说T\N{\fnArial\fs30}and word gets out that T,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.66,1:31:51.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑衣人史上最功勋卓著的探员是个叛徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}the most decorated agent in MIB history, is a traitor,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:51.75,1:31:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,组织将永远无法恢复\N{\fnArial\fs30}the agency will never recover.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.63,1:31:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们能阻止他 没必要让别人知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we stop him, no one ever has to know.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:55.63,1:31:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果你们不能阻止他呢 到时候怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what if you can't stop him? Then what?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.26,1:32:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,到时候就告诉他们是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then tell them it was me.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.39,1:32:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他们我是叛徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell them I was the traitor.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.35,1:32:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 组织会相信你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me, the agency will believe you.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.52,1:32:10.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.40,1:32:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 出了那事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right. That happened.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:31.42,1:32:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这还差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:33.58,1:32:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来开车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm driving.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.72,1:32:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,方向盘应该在这边的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That really should be here.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.26,1:32:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,国家不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not in this country.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.97,1:32:46.85,Note,0,0,0,0,,（引擎开关）
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.40,1:33:01.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,车里应该有个红色的大按钮\N{\fnArial\fs30}There should be a big red button somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:01.65,1:33:03.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 按红色按钮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! Press the red button.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:03.86,1:33:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found it.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.38,1:33:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,H 你得看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}H, you gotta see this.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.80,1:33:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,C区的一个传送门已开启\N{\fnArial\fs30}A portal from Sector C has been activated.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.68,1:33:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜂兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Hive.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.72,1:33:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上给你们派支援 完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sending you backup. Out.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.35,1:33:37.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,还记得我跟你说过 干这行就是撒谎吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remember when I told you we're in the lying business?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.77,1:33:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是T招募我的时候说的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}T said that to me when he recruited me.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.53,1:33:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说 「我们必须对全世界撒谎」\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said, "We have to lie to the world,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:42.11,1:33:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,「也就是说我们绝不能对彼此撒谎」\N{\fnArial\fs30}which means we can never lie to each other."
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.74,1:33:46.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不相信他对我们撒谎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just don't believe that he has.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.24,1:33:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你不能总是相信自己的直觉 H\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you can't always trust your gut, H.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.20,1:33:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候事情的本质和表象是相同的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes things are as they appear to be.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.04,1:33:53.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我们拯救了世界 老天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we saved the world, for God's sakes.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.12,1:33:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们携手 仅用我们的智慧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Together, with nothing but our wits.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:54.29,1:33:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,和我们的七系原子枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}and our Series-7 De-Atomizers.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.29,1:33:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I've heard.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:35.00,1:34:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- H - 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- H? - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.08,1:34:38.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能再为我讲一遍吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mind telling me one more time?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:38.33,1:34:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是如何打败蜂兽的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you beat the Hive?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.88,1:34:41.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是三年前的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was three years ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:41.88,1:34:43.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,老大T和我去对峙蜂兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}High T and I went to face the Hive.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:43.42,1:34:46.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,仅用我们的智慧和我们的七系原子枪 明白了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}with nothing but our wits and our Series-7 De-Atomizers. Cool?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:47.47,1:34:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 但你们是怎么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, but how'd you do it?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.09,1:34:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:50.43,1:34:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我只是好奇 你们是怎么做的 - 我刚告诉你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm curious. How'd you do it? - I just told you.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.81,1:34:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但你什么都没说 - 我说了好几遍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You didn't, though. - I did a few times.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.56,1:34:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 老大T和我去对峙蜂兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, High T and I went up to face the Hive.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.19,1:35:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,仅用我们的智慧和我们的七系原子枪…\N{\fnArial\fs30}with nothing but our wits and our Series-7 De-Atomizers…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.61,1:35:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是不是…我是不是在重复自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I… I'm repeating myself, aren't I?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.20,1:35:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一遍又一遍 - 一字不差\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Over and over. - Word for word.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.82,1:35:13.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯…我为什么会那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, um… Okay, why would I be doing that?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:13.74,1:35:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,H 我觉得那晚你没有打败蜂兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}H, I don't think that you beat the Hive that night.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.41,1:35:19.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你被消除记忆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you were neuralyzed.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:42.11,1:35:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来道别了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You came to say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:43.98,1:35:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,还把可爱的M带来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you brought the lovely M.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:47.36,1:35:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以真切的感受到这里的历史\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can really feel the history here.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:49.74,1:35:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃菲尔发现虫洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eiffel discovering wormholes,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:52.45,1:35:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,通往其他文明的通道\N{\fnArial\fs30}gangways to other civilizations,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.16,1:35:57.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一批外星人移民\N{\fnArial\fs30}the First Alien Migration.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:59.58,1:36:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们也在这里创造了历史 不是吗 H\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we made history here too, didn't we, H?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:03.17,1:36:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,仅用我们的智慧和我们的七系原子枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}With just our wits and our Series-7 De-Atomizers.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.84,1:36:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我们没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. We didn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:09.01,1:36:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜂兽想要银河系中最强大的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Hive wanted the most powerful weapon in the galaxy,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:12.09,1:36:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你让万格斯把它交给黑衣人\N{\fnArial\fs30}so you had Vungus bring it to Men in Black.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.76,1:36:16.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,等到武器到手 你就交给他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd wait. When it came, you'd give it to them.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.85,1:36:19.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的孩子 你总是那么聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dear boy, you were always a bright one…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.89,1:36:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这是无法阻止的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but there's no stopping this.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:23.27,1:36:26.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有这个武器碍事 所有的星球都会毁灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}With the weapon out of the way, every planet will fall,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:26.65,1:36:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,从地球开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}starting with this one.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.28,1:36:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开控制台\N{\fnArial\fs30}Step away from the controls.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:31.28,1:36:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你消除了我的记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You neuralyzed me.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.86,1:36:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我成为了拯救世界的英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Made me a hero, the guy that saved the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:36.66,1:36:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,活下来兜售谎言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Left alive to sell the lie.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.91,1:36:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们想要这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}They wanted this.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.13,1:36:45.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当时在场\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were there.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.00,1:36:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直就像是我的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were always like a son to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:50.42,1:36:51.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,H\N{\fnArial\fs30}H?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.68,1:36:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直就像是我的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were always like a son to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.30,1:36:55.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他已经不是老大T了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not High T anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:55.55,1:36:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直就像是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were always like a son.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.10,1:36:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:14.61,1:37:16.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,开枪 开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot it! Shoot it!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:20.83,1:37:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,女王陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}My queen!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.50,1:37:23.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.43,1:37:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么办 怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we do? What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.49,1:37:58.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把它抢回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna get it back.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:59.08,1:38:01.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道他还没完全消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know he's still in there somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:04.87,1:38:07.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你还没完全消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're in there somewhere!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:10.80,1:38:12.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我 H\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's me, H.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:12.59,1:38:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得吗 你想让我接任你的职位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember, you wanted me to take your place.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:19.64,1:38:20.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,M\N{\fnArial\fs30}M!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:25.81,1:38:27.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,宇宙的真谛\N{\fnArial\fs30}The truth of the universe.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.23,1:38:30.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想知道宇宙的运作方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to know how it all works.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:32.23,1:38:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,宇宙总有办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}The universe has a way of leading you.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:33.69,1:38:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,在恰当的时机\N{\fnArial\fs30}to where you're supposed to be.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.24,1:38:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,将你引向应该去的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the moment you're supposed to be there.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.04,1:38:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,女王陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}My queen!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:51.38,1:38:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不要再失去一个女王了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not losing another queen.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.31,1:39:08.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说我就像是你的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said I was like a son to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:09.19,1:39:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就像是我的父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were like a father to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.07,1:39:16.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,H\N{\fnArial\fs30}H.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.59,1:39:36.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,恰当的时机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right time…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:37.76,1:39:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,恰当的地点\N{\fnArial\fs30}right place.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:03.41,1:40:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,兵兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pawny?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:05.45,1:40:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了 - 你的女王很满意你的服务\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah? - You've served your queen well.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:08.58,1:40:10.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, my lady.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:10.42,1:40:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的荣幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was my honor.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:49.08,1:40:51.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,她真的和传说中一样严厉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So is she as tough as they say?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.50,1:40:53.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,简单概括 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a word, yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:55.08,1:40:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们居然没搞砸 - 是的 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, you didn't screw up. - No, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:57.05,1:41:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,实话实说 过程是有点磕磕绊绊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's be honest, there were a few bumps along the way,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:00.05,1:41:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一开始有些摩擦… - 还是别说实话吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- friction at the start… - Let's not be honest.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:02.05,1:41:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 是的 我们没搞砸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. No, we did not screw up.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:05.35,1:41:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说伦敦可能有问题 但其实你早就知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said there may be a problem in London, but you knew.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:08.72,1:41:11.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经有一段时间不信任伦敦分部了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hadn't trusted London branch for some time.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:11.48,1:41:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直不明白为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never understood the reason why.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:14.81,1:41:16.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,T为这个组织而活\N{\fnArial\fs30}T lived for this organization.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:16.48,1:41:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我们之中最出色的 我们会…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was the very best we had to offer. He will be…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:23.74,1:41:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,想念他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}missed.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:28.66,1:41:30.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎加入马戏团 探员M\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to the circus, Agent M.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:30.87,1:41:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的试用期结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are no longer probationary.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.00,1:41:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就对了 我的任务完成了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there you go. My work here is done, I…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:38.17,1:41:40.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的试用期开始了 - 不好意思 你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You are. - I'm sorry, what?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:40.05,1:41:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是伦敦分部的试用主管\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probationary head of London branch.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:42.30,1:41:44.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 试用主管\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. Probationary head?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:44.59,1:41:48.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来我同时被升职和降职了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It sounds like I got promoted and demoted at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:49.06,1:41:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 适应一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Try and cope.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:51.27,1:41:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,几年前 在这一切之前 T跟我提起过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Several years ago, before all this, T mentioned to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:53.64,1:41:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个年轻有位的外勤探员 他具有一定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}a young, up-and-coming field agent who had certain.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:56.60,1:41:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,领导才能 可以这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}leadership qualities, shall we say.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:58.06,1:42:00.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他错信你了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was his faith in you misplaced?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:01.40,1:42:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 我只是觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I just think there are.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:02.90,1:42:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有比我更有经验的探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}far more experienced agents than myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:05.07,1:42:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实有 但我们的高级员工\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, there are. But you have the full support.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:07.28,1:42:10.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有探员C都全力支持你\N{\fnArial\fs30}of our senior staff and, by the way, Agent C.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:10.54,1:42:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:16.96,1:42:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就是说你接受职位了 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do I take it you accept? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:19.79,1:42:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 我去跟上面的领导们谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. I'll talk to the bosses upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:21.59,1:42:23.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要清空你在伦敦分部的办公桌\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to clear your London desk.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.13,1:42:25.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,并在周一到黑衣人纽约分部报到\N{\fnArial\fs30}and report to MIB in New York on Monday.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:26.43,1:42:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,纽约\N{\fnArial\fs30}New York.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:29.51,1:42:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 探员O\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Agent O.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:33.60,1:42:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜你 试用菜鸟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations, probie.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:35.14,1:42:36.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,也恭喜你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations to you too.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:41.73,1:42:43.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该去跟你的探员们说明情况了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll want to brief your agents.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:43.99,1:42:45.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我走走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walk with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:47.82,1:42:50.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想知道宇宙的运作方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you wanted to know how it all works.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:50.87,1:42:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you do.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:52.66,1:42:56.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定也预料到了 探员M\N{\fnArial\fs30}And as you will no doubt have divined, Agent M,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:57.79,1:42:59.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是有代价的\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's a price.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:41.33,1:43:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊 你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey there. What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:43.25,1:43:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉O 回去之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told O I had to take care of.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:44.34,1:43:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有几件事要处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}a couple things before I went back.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:46.05,1:43:47.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 比如说偷我的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? What, like stealing my car?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:47.42,1:43:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 开你的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, like driving it.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:50.22,1:43:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少这回你坐对边了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're on the right side, at least.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:51.51,1:43:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我学得很快\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a quick study.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:52.76,1:43:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,搭我回伦敦好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a lift back to London?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:54.56,1:43:55.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,公路旅行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Road trip.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:59.69,1:44:01.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来 起来 起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up, up, up!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:01.48,1:44:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 不需要这一出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God. Did not need that.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:03.90,1:44:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能用那个洗脑的玩意闪我一下吗 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you zap me with that forgetting thing, please?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:06.11,1:44:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这做什么 兵兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here, Pawny?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:07.28,1:44:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点习惯见到我 小白脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get used to seeing me, pretty boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:09.15,1:44:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是你的新保姆 - 他是我的新什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm your new babysitter. - He's my new what?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:11.53,1:44:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 保姆 - 女王的命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Babysitter. - Queen's orders.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:13.12,1:44:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说没有我 你这个可怜虫\N{\fnArial\fs30}She says the chance of your sorry ass.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:14.66,1:44:16.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,活下来的几率为零\N{\fnArial\fs30}surviving without me: Zero.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:16.49,1:44:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可没那么说 不是原话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I did not say that… exactly.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:19.21,1:44:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说 「无限接近于零」\N{\fnArial\fs30}She said, "Slim to zero."
Dialogue: 0,1:44:20.33,1:44:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我四舍五入为零了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I rounded it down to zero.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:21.62,1:44:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为感觉就是零\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I feel like it's zero.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:23.54,1:44:24.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,当作是离别礼物吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Consider it a parting gift.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:24.92,1:44:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 我拯救了世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. I saved the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:26.75,1:44:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道 因为你当时快被掐死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You couldn't tell because you were getting choked on the floor.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:29.01,1:44:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我有选择权吗 - 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do I even have a choice? - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:31.05,1:44:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 好了 那个红色的小按钮在哪呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! There we go. All right. Where's that little red button?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:33.80,1:44:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:36.93,1:44:38.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是不喜欢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still don't like you.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:38.18,1:44:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢这个选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love that option.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:39.20,1:44:39.93,Note,0,0,0,0,,（引擎开关）
Dialogue: 0,1:44:46.32,1:44:48.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一台复杂的机器 所以要小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a complicated piece of machinery, so be careful.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:48.69,1:44:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:50.19,1:44:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我决定相信直觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna trust my gut.
